<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Oyda New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Luqasa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luqasa Xaafide Yesuus Kiristtoosa Wonggele</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luqasa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luqa.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luqasa Xaafide</para>
  <para style="mt2">Yesuus Kiristtoosa Wonggele</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gele</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesuusa dooride taphpho lam77i hawaaruntsi gidda Luqasa baaya. Luqasa Wonggele, Yesuusa tiino nabunts doontte ye7oda ga7intti ohinttidanno, Isra7eeluntsi kaseppa kafittera yezide «Kiristtoosa» maaqqidanno as kochchi ubba ashshizaya maaqqidanno qonccizane. Luqasa, fa maxaafte Yesuusa dahuntsis Wonggele sabbakodes fa adeppa kiitinttidaya maaqqidanno hyanna Wonggeltte asuntsis yeze dumma dumma madhappa kessizaya maaqqidanno ohida. Luqasa Wonggele gidda, Yesuusa ye7e baz ohize tiino zofantten Yesuusa ude Salo kezidanno ohize faaditsi zofantte benttii ohinttidanna ufays baz. Yesuusa Salo kezidannippa maaqqii ammano wayzi diccezakon dalggezakon ohize taarikito hyay Wonggele xaafize hawaaruntsi oocha maxaafite xaafida.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiitanchcho mazmure baz, Yesuusa yelinttide wode wude yenggizuntsi hyanggi bi7idanno ohize taarike, Yesuusa na7atitsa Xoozze keetstsa hyanggidanno, yiqsinttize Samaara atstse bazin dhabii benttide na7ay baz ohize taarike, Luqasa Wonggele xalaala benttize taarike. Luqasa Wonggeltte gaxappa gaxa yellodes yeze waanna qoftta woosa baz, Geeshi Ayyaanabaz, Yesuusa oocha gidda maachchuntsis yeze bessin Xoozii nagara maarizanno.</para>
  <para style="iot">Aafe Qofuntsi</para>
  <para style="io1">Gele qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xammaqize Wahannisan Yesuusa yelintton dichiton <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:5-2:52">1:5—2:52</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xammaqize Wahannisa oocha <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3:1-20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusa xinqqatton fattaninttidanno <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:21-4:13">3:21—4:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusa Galila oochchide oocha <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4:14—9:50</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galilappa Yerusalaame yellodes <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:27">9:51—19:27</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wurssutsi saamintte Yerusalaame kara gancce <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 19:28-23:56">19:28—23:56</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Hyayqoppa dendde, asis qonccen salo keze <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 24:1-53">24:1-53</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Bonchcho Tewofiloosa, nu gidda folinttide bazis gaamuntsi, faas dandda7inttide gaar xaafida. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Yinna taarikito un xaafidanna tiinoppa aykkii aafe markkuntsin qaala xaafii nuus ohidanno. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Taanin ta baggara tiinoppa qoppii bi7idanippa suuba yinna taarikita hyanidanno luulizii nees Tewofiloosas xaafizanna taas lo77o maaqqii benttida. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Yinnan, ne tamaaridanna turo maaqqidanno erisodes.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xammaqize Wahannisa yelintte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Yihuda kaat Heroodisa wode Abiya baggappa maaqqide Zakkariyaasa gaaze Ayhude kahine yene. E machchitan Aarona kochchappa. I suntsitan Elssabeexo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 24:10">1 Zeena 24:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Lam77untsin Laatstse wogan kiitto ubba naagii bore baayzin Xoozze tiintte xillotitsara yezida. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Yi7op attin Elssabeexa dhoontsi maaqqide gisho unttis na7a baaya. Lam77untsin cinggida.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Fettii wode Zakkariyaasa fa tarttii ode Xoozze tiino kahinetitsara oochchane. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Kahinetitsi wogara Xoozze keetstsa gelii ixaane cugissades eza ixa yellida. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Ixaane cugize wode asuntsi ubba bale woossane.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Laatstse kiitanchchize zharsho zharshize bestippa mizaqi zalara eqqii benttida. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Zakkariyaasa eza bi7i tannii gaama zhashtida. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Yezin kiitanchchize eego, «Zakkariyaasa zhashtippe; ne woosita sinttida. Ne machchita Elssabeexa dhiiratsi na7a yeloda, eza Wahannisa ga7i ne suntsoda. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>E nees wallon ufayssi maaqqada; gaamuntsi E yelintte ufayttoda. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Laatstse tiino E damma maaqqada; woyne ushshii maaqqin melle matstsize ushshii uzhaama. Fa inttii sazite yezara Geeshi Ayyaanara kumoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:3">Faydo 6:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Isra7eele asuntsappa gaamuntsana fa Laatstse, Xoozzego mahoda. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Aduntsi wozintto na7untsago mahoda, kiitinttoosuntsana xillotitsi cinccatitsago mahode gaar, Laatstsis koshshize worzha giigisades Eeliyaasa ayyaanaran wolqqara Laatstse tiintte hyammada» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5-6">Mil. 4:5-6</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Zakkariyaasa kiitanchchizego, «Ta yinno akkora erode? Taaran ta machchitira cinggida» gayda.<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Kiitanchchize mahi, «Taanii Xoozze tiintte eqqize Gabre7ele. Hyanna misiraachchito nees ohodes Xoozappa kiitinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dane. 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:21">9:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Yikke, wodito naagii folinttode ta qaaltto ne ammananxii ixxide gisho hyanna folinttode wontsis ne doontta muume maaqqada, ohinttodesin ne dandda7aama» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Ye wode Zakkariyaasa Xoozze keetstsite gelii gam7ide gisho akko yi7ido ga7i asuntsi bale naagitera gam7ida. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>E bale kezii unttana ohissades dandda7ikaaya. Malla kushera beezanip attin ohinttodes dandda7oosanno bi7ide wode qonccitsi bi7idanno erida.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Zakkariyaasa oocha wodito folii fa kara maaqqida. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Yinnippa suuba, E machchita Elssabeexa wodaxida. Ichchin agina kumutsi fana geentsi asis benttikaayzara gam7ida. <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>Iza, «Laatstsii fa maarotitsite ta toochito as giddappa hyaasodes bi7i hyanna wodite hyanno taas oochchida» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa yelinttodanna tiinidhii ohinttida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Elssabeexa wodaxidannippa izippuntsa agintte, Xoozii Kiitanchcho Gabre7ele Galila gade yeze Naazirete katama kiittida. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>Ezin Yoosefa gaaze kaat Dawute kochchappa maaqqide atstses oocinttide wudurttigo kiitinttida. Yinna wudurtta Mayramo ga7inttane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:18">Maato. 1:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Kiitanchcho iigo hyanggi, «Gaama kadhinttidanne, saro nees maaqqe, Xoozii neera yene» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Mayrama E ohite gaama tannii, «Hyanna akko saritse» ga7i qoppida. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Kiitanchchize mahi, «Mayrame, zhashtippe; ne Xoozze tiintte nashsho denggida. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Yikke ne wodaxoda dhiiratsi na7a yeloda, E suntsiton Yesuusa ga7i suntsoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:21">Maato. 1:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>E damma maaqqada, Ubbappa kattara Xoozze na7a ga7intti xeeginttoda. Laatstse Xoozze E aday Dawute araata ees inggoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:32-33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">2 Sam. 7:12-13</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa. 9:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>E Yayqooba kochchalla afa medhina ka7itoda; E ka7itumttis hyal7e baaya» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Mayrama kiitanchchizego, «Yinna wayzi hyanode? Ta dhiiratsara yellinttikaaya» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Kiitanchchize mahi, «Geeshi Ayyaana neella afa wodhdhoda, Ubbappa kattara Xoozze wolqqita neella afa shemppoda. Yinnii gisho, yelinttide geeshi na7ay Xoozze Na7a ga7inttoda. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Yikke, ne igintta Elssabeexa fa cimatitsi laytsite dhiiratsi na7a wodaxida. Iza dhoontsi ga7inttidanno, yezin hyatte izippuntsa agina aykkida. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Xoozza gamizebaz baaya»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Medho 18:14</ref></char></note>yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Mayrama, «Yeezako, taanii Laatstse arttis, ne qaaltti gaar taas yi7o» yagayda. Yinnippa suuba, kiitanchchize iippa shaakkinttida.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Mayrama yinna saamintte denddii Yihuda sa7a yeze fettii ale katama qitida. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Zakkariyaasa kara gelii Elssabeexo sarotsida. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Elssabeexa Mayrama sarotsizanno si7ize wode I saztte yeze na7ay ufayssara dollida. Elssabeexa Geeshi Ayyaanara kumii, <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Neenii maachuntsappa anjjinttidanno, ne wodaxide na7ayin anjjinttidaya. <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Yi7o yezin, ta Laatstse intte, neenii taago ye7ode gaar ta oode? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Yikke ne sarotitsito ta si7ize wode ta sazite yeze na7ay ufayssappa dollida. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Laatstsii foloda ga7i inggide qaaltto ammanidanna, iza anjjinttidanno» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mayrami mazmure</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Mayrama hyannii gaara yagayda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«Ta shemppita Laatstsa bonchchane,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:46-55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">1 Sam. 2:1-10</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>ta Ayyaanze gaalla Xoozzella ufayttane.<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>E fa arttii toochito bi7ida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">Hyaynoppa aykkii yeletitsi ubba tana anjjinttidanno ga7oda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 1:11">1 Sam. 1:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>Wolqqaama maaqqide E, taas damma baz oochchida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">E suntsita Geeshi.<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Eza bonchchizuntsalla afa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">E maarotitsita medhinappa medhina yellodes.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Fa qesite mintsi baz oochchida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">fa wozintte uturtizuntsanna lalida.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>Damma kaatuntsana araatizeppa wodhizida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">Fa ommito toochizuntsana bonchchida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:11">Iyo. 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:19">12:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Naydhdhiduntsana lo77o bazara mishshida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">yezin duruntsana kallo kushe dakkida.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Fa maarotitsito qoppii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">Fa ariza Isra7eele maaddida.<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>Yinnan nu aduntsis ohide qaala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">Abrahamasin E zarttis ga7idanno medhinas folodes»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">1 Sam. 2:1-10</ref> </char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:7">Medho 17:7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 1:55">yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Mayrama Elssabeexi kale hyaydzdzii agina gaar gam77i fa kara maaqqida.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xammaqize Wahannisa yelintte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Elssabeexis yelo qamma yellin dhiiratsi na7a yelida. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>I dootsuntsin I iginuntsi Laatstsii damma maarotitsi oochchidanno si7i, iira wolla ufayttida. <verse eid="LUK 1:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Osfuntso qammite zhooga na7aya garrazodes yi7ida. E aday suntsite Zakkariyaasa ga7i suntsodes koyda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:59 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Leewe 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Yezin intta, «Ade, Wahannisa ga7inttodes beezane» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 1:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Unttin, «Ne iginutsappa hyay suntsera xeeginttide ooden baaya» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>E aday oode ga7i suntsodyezako erodes koyi eza malla oocida. <verse eid="LUK 1:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>E xaafizebaz oocii ekkii, «E suntsita Wahannisa» ga7i xaafida. Ubbuntsi E xaafidanno bi7i gaama qoppida. <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Iira Zakkariyaasa il7antsita bilinttida, Xooz galatittera ohintte aykkida. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Dootsuntsi ubba zhashmora kumida. Hyanna hyanidanna ale Yihuda sa7a ohinttida. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Yinno si7eze ubbuntsi, «Hyay na7ay akko yi7ad yessa?» ga7i fa gidda ohinttida. Laatstse kushita eera yene.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zakkariyaasa tinbbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Wahannisa aday Zakkariyaasa Geeshi Ayyaanara kumii hyannii gaara yaga7i tinbbite ohida.<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>«Isra7eele Laatstse Xoozze galatintto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">yi7i fa asuntsana wozida.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Fa arize Dawute keetstsa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">atotits wolqqa dentsida.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Yinnan zaga wode geeshi nabunts doontte ohinttidanni fana,<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>E ashita nu morkkuntsappan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">nuura olinttize ubbunts kushtippa.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Yinno E oochchidanna nu aduntsis fa maarotitsito beessadesin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">fa geeshi caaqito naagodes.<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>Nu aday Abrahamas caaqqide</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:73">caaqito qoppodesin<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>nu morkkuntsi kushtippa kessii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">zhashimo baytsi ees kiitinttode fana.<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>Nu laytsite ubbanne geeshshatitsaran xillotitsara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">fa tiintte nuna essodes.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>Ta na7ayo, neenii Ubbappa kattara Xoozze nabe ga7inttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:76 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mil. 3:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">Laatstse ogito loytsodes ne E tiintte hyanggoda.<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>Un nagartta uccinttin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">un atotitsi era denggodanno ne Laatstse worzhitis ohoda.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Nu Xoozze lo77o maarotitsitippa denddii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">wontta xalqe nuus saloppa kezida.<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>Yinnan dhuma giddan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">hyayqo dasho oomo yezuntsis foo7issades,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">nu tohiton saro ogego mahodes»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 1:79">yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:79 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isa. 9:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Na7ay diccida, Ayyaanara minggida, Isra7eele asuntsis benttode wontsis akko baayze ganasa yezida.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa yelintte</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Maato. 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Ye wode Roome gade yeze as ubbuntsi faydinttode fanan suntsita xaafinttode fana kaati Awugisxoosa kiittida. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Yinnan Qerenoosa Sooriya gade ahize wode oochinttide tiino faydo. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Yinnii gisho, fettii fettii asi fa suntsito xaafinttodes fa yelinttide gade qitida.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Yoosefan Dawute keetstsappan kochchappa maaqqide gisho Galila Naazirete katamappa denddii Dawute katama maaqqide Yihuda Beeteleme qitida. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Hyanggodera, yelodes wode hyal7ide E oocii gaddide, Mayramira wolla xaafinttodes hyanggida. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Un ize yezin iis yelo wode yellida. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Fa anggis na7aya yelida. Curqqara xaaxii zaqqo aqize keetsi bessi dhabide gisho gongga gidda woytstsida.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wude yenggizuntsanan kiitanchchon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Yinna gadite qamma duro wude yenggite zooze aqize wude yenggizuntsi yene. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Laatstse kiitanchcho yi7i un kale eqqida. Laatstse bonchcho un kantto wutii foo7ida; unttin damma zhashimo zhashtida. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Kiitanchchize unttis, «Zhashtippete! Yikke, as ubbannis maaqqide damma ufayssi misiraachcho ekkii yi7ida. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Yinnan, Dawute katamite ashshizay yinttis hyayno yelinttida. Ezin Laatstse Kiristtoosa. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Yinnan yinttis malla maaqqe; zhooga na7ay curqqara xaaxintti gongga gidda woy7idaya yin demmada» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Qoppikaayzin gaama Salo kiitanchchuntsi kiitanchchizera fettilla benttii, yaga7i galatida,<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>«Bonchcho Xoozzes afa salo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">sarotitsi sa7alla afa Xoozii kadhize asis maaqqe.» Yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Kiitanchchuntsi unttappa shaakkintti salo kezidannippa suuba wude yenggizuntsi, «Ane Laatstsii nuus qonccizide bazin hyanidanno be7ades Beeteleme yedhdhote» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Unttin ellisii hyanggida. Mayramo, Yoosefan zhooga na7ay gongga gidda woy7idaya bi7ida. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Bi7i maaqqii na7ibaz unttis ohidanno, geeshi yinna besite yeze asuntsis markkidhida. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Yinno si7ide ubba wude yenggizuntsi ohidanno gaama qoppida. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Mayrama hyanide baz ubba fa wozintte qoppittera yene yeshsha. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Yenggizuntsi unttis ohidanni gaara yi7in bi7ida. Yinnii gisho, fa si7idebazisin bi7idebaz ubbannis Xoozze bonchchiten galatitte maaqqida.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Xoozze keetstsa kanggida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Osfuntsa qammite, garraze wode yellin, iis agina attodannippa tiino kiitanchcho gaddide suntsite Yesuusa ga7inttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Leewe 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:3">Luqa. 1:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Muse higge fana un geezhize wode folinttidanippa suuba Yoosefaran Mayramira zhooga na7a fa Laatstses immades Yerusalaame qitida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22-24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:6-8">Leewe 12:6-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>Yinnan, Laatstse higgera, «Dhiiratsi maaqqide anggis na7a ubbuntsi Laatstsis dummudhidaya maaqqe» ga7intti xaafinttidanno folodes.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Keze 13:2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12">12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Mahi Laatstse higge, lam77i koka woy wolle zharshodes kanggida. <verse eid="LUK 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Ye wode geeshin ammanora mintsii maaqqide Simoona ga7inttize atstse Yerusalaame yene. E Isra7eeluntsana ashshiza naagitera yene. Geeshi Ayyaanan eella afa yene. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Mahi Kiristtoosa bi7ikaayzara hyayqqamanno Geeshi Ayyaana ees beezin erii yene. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>E ye wode Ayyaana kaalitsin Xoozze keetstsa qitida. Na7ay inttiran adera woga folodes zhooga na7aya Yesuusa ekkii gelide wode.<figure style="fig" alt="Herod’s temple at time of Christ" file="LB00250B.TIF" size="span" ref="2:27">Xoozze Keetsi Kirsttoosa wode</figure> <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simoona mokkii ekkii na7aya iringgi, yaga7i Xooz galatida.<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>«Laatstso ne taas gelide qaaltti fana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">hyatte ne ariza sarora moyzo.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Ta aafta asi ubbunts tiino ne giigizide,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>ne atotitsito bi7ida.<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>Yinnan Ayhude maaqqoosse ubbuntsis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">Xoozze ogito geeshize foo7o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">ne asunts Isra7eeluntsis bonchcho» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Yoosefaran Mayramira E baz ohinttidanne gaama qoppida. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Simoona unttana anjjida. Intta Mayramigo, «Yikke hyay na7ay Xoozappa doorinttide gaama Isra7eeluntsis un gol7itisin un dendditis malla maaqqada. Yinnon gaamuntsi ixxane. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>Ne shemppitan mahi mashshara cadinttoda» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 2:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Mahi Aseere kochchappa maaqqide Faanu7ela na7ita Haanna ga7inttize nabita yene. Iza gaama cinggida; iza azinzera laappun bere yezida. <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>I azinze hyayqqin osfun tam oyddii bere maaqqade wontsis qamman awara face baytsi woosaran xoomara Xoozze Keetstsa oochchane. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Iza yinna saate hyanggi Xooz galatida; Yerusalaame atotitsi wode naagize ubbuntsis zhooga na7ay baz markkidhida. <verse eid="LUK 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Yoosefaran Mayramira Laatstse higgite kiitinttide wogito ubbanno folidannippa suuba Galila sa7a yeze fa katama Naazirete maaqqida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 2:23">Maato. 2:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Na7ay dicciteran minggitara hyanggida. Cinccatitsara kumida; Xoozze aadho keehatitsita eella afa yene.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Xoozze keetstsa qitida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Yoosefaran Mayramira Faasika Ba7ale bonchchodes ubba bere Yerusalaame qitane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Keze 12:1-27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-8">Mahe 16:1-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Yesuusas taphpho lam77i bere maaqqide wode tiinoppa hyanggizanii fana baalito bonchchodes hyanggida. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Ba7ale bonchchidanippa suuba kara maaqqize wode na7ay Yesuusa Yerusalaame attida. Yezin Yoosefaran Mayramira E Yerusalaame attidanno erikaaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>E kara maaqqide asara yeze gaara yi7in un fettii qamma oge yedhdhida. E baayzanno eridannippa suuba fa iginuntsi kalen lagguntsi kale koyda. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>E ize dhabin koyitera suuba Yerusalaame yellodes yi7ida.<verse eid="LUK 2:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Hyaydzdzii qammappa suuba Xoozze Keetstsa asttamaarunts gidda bettii unbaz si7itten unttana oocitera yezin denggida. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Eza si7ize ubbuntsi E qofiten mahite gaama qoppida.<verse eid="LUK 2:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Kara asuntsi eza denggide wode gaama qoppida. E inttan, «Ta na7ayo, akkosi nuna hyannigaara oochchido? Ne aderan taaran nena koyitera waayida» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Tana akkos koye? Taanii, ta aday keetstsa yessades beezanno eroso?» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Yezin E unttago gaydanno un tiirikaaya.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Yinnippa suuba, unttara wolla Naazirete katama yi7ida. Unttis kiitinttii yezida. E intta yinna ubbabazito wozintte gaddii naagane. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Yesuusa, cinccatitsera, ude dichcharan sabara Xooz tiinon as tiino diccane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:26">1 Sam. 2:26</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:4">Aazi. 3:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Xammaqize Wahannisa sibkkete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Maato. 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar. 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Waha. 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Kaati Xibaaryoosa Roome gade ka7itin, taphpho ichchintsa bere, Phenxe Philaaxoosa Yihuda ahize wode Heroodisa Galila ahize wode E ishe Filphoosa Ixuuriyasan Xirakkonddoosa ahize wode Lisaniyoosa Ablaanisa ahize wode <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Haannaran Qayyaafara kahinunts hyalaqa maaqqii yezin, Xoozze qaala Zakkariyaasa na7a Wahannisago akko baayze ganasa yi7ida.<figure style="fig" alt="High priest" file="HK00267B.TIF" size="span" ref="3:2">Kahinunts hyalaqa</figure> <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Wahannisa, «Yin nagarttippa maaqqii xammaqinttote. Xoozii yin nagartto atto ga7oda» yaga7i tamaarssite Yorddaanosa borkka gaxara yeze sa7a ubba qitida. <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Yinnan nabe Isayaasa fa maxaafite,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Isa. 40:3-5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">«Akko baayze ganasa gidda fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">uukkize atstse qaaltta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">‹Laatstse ogito giigizote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">worogiton luulizote.<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Doochii ubba kumoda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">deren dhoqqa bessin ziqqi gawuda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Wobbo ogita luuloda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">giigoose horogita giigoda.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>As kochchi ubba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:6">Xoozze atotitsito be7ada› »</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:6">ga7i xaafidanifanna hyanida.<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Wahannisa, fa kushite xammaqinttodes yi7ide gaama asuntsago, «Hyantsi, shooshi na7untso yo7odes yeze hyanqoppa attode gaar yinttana zoride oode?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Maato. 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Yikke, yin maarinttes beezze lo77o oocha oochchote, yin wozintte, ‹Nuus, nu aday Abrahama yene ga7i ceeqinttippete.› Hyankka si7ote, hyantsi shuchchuntsappa Xoozii Abrahamas na7a kessodes dandda7ane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Waha. 8:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Hyatte, gandde minxa xapho yene. Yikke, lo77o aafe aafoosse minxa ubba gachchinttii tama ollinttoda» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Maato. 7:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Asuntsi, «Yeezin nuunii akko oochchode?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Wahannisa mahi, «Lam77i afula yeze asi baayzes shago. Katstsa yeze baayzes shago» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Qaraxe gachchizuntsii xammaqinttodes yi7i, «Asttamaarizayo, nuunii akko oochchode?» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:29">Luqa. 7:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>E mahi, «Yin gachchisades beezanippa aatsii ekkippete» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Mahi wottaddaruntsi yi7i, «Nuunii akko oochchode» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Wahannisa, «Obazin wolqqara dafii ekkippete, ooden worddora mootippete, yin damoozita yinttis maaqqada» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Asuntsi Kiristtoosa ufayssara naagii yeze gisho Wahannisa, «E Kiristtoosa maaqqane?» yaga7i fa wozintte qoppida. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Wahannisa ubbuntsis mahi, «Taanii yinttana hyaatsara xammaqane, yezin taappa aadhii miinggize ye7oda. Taanii E caamma gadito billodes beezoosse asi. E yinttana Geeshi Ayyaanaran tamara xammaqoda. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Uduma yeze katstsa geeshodes fitstse E kushite yene. Geeshi katstsa fa fachite gussoda; buurtto dhaboose tamar michchoda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Mahi Wahannisa asuntsana gaama zorii Wonggele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Wonggele: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Girike doonara Wonggele gaaze qaalize gaama ufayssize ohe woy misiraachcho ga7e. Yinna misiraachchitan Kiristtoosa as kochchi ubba medhina firddappa ashshodes kiitinttii yi7ide damma ufayssi (Luqa. 1:19; 2:10)</char></note> ohida.<verse eid="LUK 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Yezin Wahannisa Heroodisa fa ishe machchito, Heroodiyada, ekkide gishon melle iita oochiti gisho kaccide wode<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19-20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3-4">Maato. 14:3-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17-18">Mar. 6:17-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Heroodisa kasenilla afa melle iita baz ubba gujjii Wahannisa woyne geltsida.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa xammaqintte</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Maato. 1:1-17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar. 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Wahannisa accinttodanippa tiino as ubba xammaqii maaqqin, Yesuusan mahi xammaqinttida. E woossodera salo bugunttida. <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>Geeshi Ayyaana wolle fana benttitera eella afa bettida. Saloppa «Ta kadhize na7ay nena; ne tana ufayssane yaga7ize» qaala yi7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Medho 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Maz. 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa. 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Maato. 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar. 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luqa. 9:35</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Yesuusa tamaarse aykkize wode ees hyasttam bere maaqqadera, asuntsi eza Yoosefa na7a ga7i qoppida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:23">Yoosefa Eele na7a, <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Eele Maate na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">Maate Leewe na7a, Leewe Malkka na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">Malkka Yoona na7a, Yoona Yoosefa na7a,<verse eid="LUK 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>Yoosefa Mataate na7a, Mataate Amoxe na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">Amoxe Nahoome na7a, Nahoome Asiliime na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">Asiliime Naage na7a, <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>Naage Ma7aate na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">Ma7aate Mataatiye na7a, Mataatiye Samaye na7a,<verse eid="LUK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Samaye Yoosefa na7a Yoosefa Yihuda na7a, Yihuda Yoonane na7a, Yoonane Rase na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">Rase Zerubaabela na7a, Zerubaabela Salatiyaale na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">Salatiyaale Neere na7a, <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>Neere Miilkkii na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">Miilkkii Haade na7a, Haade Qoosame na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">Qoosame Elmodaane na7a, Elmodaane Eera na7a,<verse eid="LUK 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Eera Yoose7e na7a, Yoose7e Alaazare na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">Alaazare Yoorame na7a, Yoorame Maate na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">Maate Leewe na7a, <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>Leewe Simoona na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">Simoona Yihuda na7a, Yihuda Yoosefa na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">Yoosefa Yoonane na7a, Yoonane Eliyaaqeme na7a,<verse eid="LUK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Eliyaaqeme Maliyye na7a, Maliyye Maynaane na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">Maynaane Maate na7a, Maate Naatane na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">Naatane Dawute na7a, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>Dawute Issey na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">Issey Iyobeede na7a, Iyobeede Boo7eza na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">Boo7eza Salmoona na7a, Salmoona Na7asoona na7a,<verse eid="LUK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>Na7asoona Aminaadabe na7a, Aminaadabe Raame na7a, Raame Arnne na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">Arnne Asroome na7a, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>Asroome Faarese na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">Faarese Yihuda na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">Yihuda Yayqooba na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">Yayqooba Yisaaqa na7a, Yisaaqa Abrahama na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">Abrahama Taara na7a, <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Taara Naakkore na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">Naakkore Saruuge na7a, Saruuge Rehu na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">Rehu Faaleqe na7a, Faaleqe Ebeera na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">Ebeera Seela na7a, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>Seela Qaynaane na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">Qaynaane Arfakisaada na7a, Arfakisaada Seeme na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">Seeme Nohe na7a, Nohe Laamehe na7a,<verse eid="LUK 3:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Laamehe Matusaala na7a, Matusaala Heenoke na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">Heenoke Yaarede na7a, Yaarede Malaal77ela na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">Malaal77ela Qaynaane na7a, <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>Qaynaane Heenosa na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">Heenosa Seeta na7a, Seete Addaama na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">Addaama Xooz na7a.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fattaninttida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Maato. 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mar. 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Yesuusa Geeshi Ayyaanara kumii Yorddaanosa borkkappa maaqqide fana Ayyaana eza akko baayze ganasa kanggida. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>Ize oyttam awaran qamma xalahera fattaninttida. Ye wodite akkon mu7ikaayzara gam77ide gisho wurssutsite naydhdhida.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Xalahe eego, «Neenii Xoozze na7a maaqqiko ane hyay shuchchiza daabbo maaqqo ga7i kiitto» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Asi daabbo xalaalara yezoos ga7intti Xoozze qaaltte xaafinttida» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Mahe 8:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Yinnippa suuba, Xalahe Yesuusa pharggo derella afa kessii hyanna alamtti ka7itumtto aafe qiphii maaqqades beezida. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Xalahe, «Hyanna ubbannis adetits wolqqa bonchchon taas ingginttida. Taanii kadhize oodesin inggize gisho nees inggoda. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Yinnii gisho, ne taas goynizako ubba nees maaqqada» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Ne Laatstsa, ne Xoozza, eza xalaala goynon ees oochcho ga7intti Xoozze qaaltte xaafinttida» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Mahe 6:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Wurssutsite Xalahe Yesuusa Yerusalaame kanggi Xoozze Keetsitis kusttella afa essi, Neenii Xoozze na7a maaqqiko ane sulle sa7a nena olo. <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>Akkos gayko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">« ‹Nena naagize fa Kiitanchcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10">ne gisho kiittoda ga7intti Xoozze qaaltte xaafinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Maz. 91:11-12</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>Un ne tohita shuchchalla dhubunttaame gaar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">fa kushite dhoqi yiizii nena dentsoda› ga7intti Xoozze qaaltte xaafinttida»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 4:11">yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Ne Laatstsa Xoozza fattanippe ga7intti Xoozze qaaltte xaafinttida» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Mahe 6:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Xalahe Yesuusa fatantto ubba hyaasidanippa suuba melle wottize wode denggode wontsis eeppa shaakkinttida.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Galila oocha aykkida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Maato. 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mar. 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Yesuusa Geeshi Ayyaana wolqqara kumii Galila maaqqida. E suntsita kale yeze sa7a ubba kezida. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>E Ayhude woosa keetstsa gelii tamaarssida; asuntsi ubbuntsi eza galatida.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Izippa E diccide katama Naazirete yi7ida. Tiinop oochchizanni fana Sambbata wode Ayhude woosa keetstsa gelida. Nabbabodesin denddii eqqida. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Nabe Isayaasa maxaafize xaxinttidaya ees inggin, bugii, hyannigaara yaga7i xaafinttidanno denggida:<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>«Laatstse Ayyaana taalla afa yene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">dahuntsis Wonggele ohode fana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">Xoozii tana doorida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Acinttiduntsis bilintte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">qooqiduntsis be7e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">un7inttiduntsana wallo kessodes,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18-19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Isa. 61:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>Xoozii ashshodes qoppide bertto ohode fana tana kiittida»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 4:19">yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Yinnippa suuba, maxaafiza xaaxii Ayude woosa keetstsa inggida. Ayhude woosa Keetstsa yeze asuntsi ubba dakkii be7ine. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>E, «Hyaychche yin hyaytira yin si7ize hyanna maxaafe qaaltta hyayno folinttida» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Ubbuntsi E baz lo77o baz ohinttane. Mahi E doonttippa kezze aadho keehatitsi kumide qaalttippa denddi gaama qoppii, «Hyay Yoosefa na7a baane?» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>E, « ‹Akimzayo ane nena ashsho, Qifirnahoome gidda ne oochchidanno nu si7idanno mahi hyanne ne katamite oochcho› yaga7ize aazizera yin tana gawudannis so7e baaya» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Mahi, «Turo ohine; nabe fa yelinttide gadite bonchchinttoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Waha. 4:44</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>«Ta yinttis turo ohine; salo hyaydzdzii beren bagge gorddinttin mintsi naye sa7alla ubba yeze Eeliyaasa wode gaama budanuntsi Isra7eele gidda yene yeshsha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Kat. 17:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Eeliyaasa unttappa fettigon kiitinttikaaya. Yezin Saraptta gidda yeze fettii budanttigo kiitinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:8-16">1 Kat. 17:8-16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Nabe Elssa7e wode Isra7eele gidda gaama qursumara hyargginttizuntsi yene yeshsha. Yezin Sooriya atstse Ni7imaanep attin ooden faxikaaya» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2 Kat. 5:1-14</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Ayhude woosa Keetstsa yeze asi ubbuntsi yinno si7eze wode gaama zhilidhdhida. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Fa bettide bestippa denddii derella afa keexinttide katamttippa gaxa kessii urqqii dakkodes gaga doona kanggida. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Yezin E un giddara kantsii aadhida.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa tuna ayyaana kessida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mar. 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Izippa Galila sa7a yeze Qifirnahoome katama qitida. Ize Sambbata wode asuntsana tamaarssida. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>E tamaarssizanna adetits wolqqara maaqqide gisho ubbuntsi E timirttite gaama qoppida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28-29">Maato. 7:28-29</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Maz. 91:11-12</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Ayhude woosa Keetstsa tuna ayyaana aykkide atstse yene. <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>E, «Naazirete Yesuusa nuna akkos waaytse nuuppa hyaakko; ne yi7idanna nuna dhabssodesine? Ne oona yezako ta erane. Neenii Xoozzeppa yi7ide Geeshi» yaga7i uukkida.<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Yesuusa tuna ayyaanzego, «Si7i ga7i hyay atstseppa kezo» yaga7i seerida. Tuna ayyaanze atstsa as ubbunts tiino olii ashshii akkon qohikaayzara dakkii kezida.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Asuntsi ubba gaama qoppida. Woligo, «Yeezin, hyanna akko timirtte? Tuna ayyaanuntsana adetits wolqqara kiittane; unttin kezane» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>E suntsita kara gancce ubba kezida.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa gaama hyargginttizuntsana fatstsida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Maato. 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mar. 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa Ayhude woosa keetstsappa kezii Simoona keetstsa gelida. Simoona machchitii intta mintsii omma otstsin micha hyargginttida. Izo fatstsode gaar Yesuusa woossida. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>I yitsitigo shiiqii zuggii I hyarggiza seerida. Michita ashshin ellisii denddii unttana mokkida.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Awa gelodes yi7adera dumma dumma hyarggera aykinttide asuntsana eego ki7ida. E fetella fetella afa fa kushito gaddii fatstsida. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Tuna ayyaanuntsi mahi, «Neenii, Xoozze na7a» ga7i wuysitera gaama asappa kezida. Yezin E unttana seerida. E Kiristtoosa maaqqidanno un erize gisho fettii bazin ohaame fana kayda.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Galila tamaarssida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Hyaga wonttize wode Yesuusa fettii asi baayze bessa qitida. Asuntsi koytera E yeze besite yi7ida. Unttappa E shaakkintti qitaame gaar kayda. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Yezin E, «Taanii melle katama hyanggi Xoozze ka7itumo Wonggele markkidhades beezane. Ta kiitinttidanna yinnisi» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Yihuda sa7a yeze Ayhude woosa Keetstsa sabbakida.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa dooride tiino tamaaruntsana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Maato. 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar. 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Fettii wode Yesuusa Gensareexe Abba kale eqqezin gaama asuntsi E kantto wutii eza un7itsi, E tamaarssize Xoozze qaaltto si7ine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:1-2">Maato. 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:9-10">Mar. 3:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1">4:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Ize hyaatsi gaxa yeze lam77i gongguntsana bi7ida. Molo aykkize asuntsi gongguntsappa wodhdhii fa molo aykkize gitto meeccane yeshsha. <figure style="fig" alt="Fisher men in their fishing boat" file="HK00208B.TIF" size="span" ref="5:2">Molo aykkize asuntsi gongge gidda</figure> <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Yentsi gongguntsappa Simoonasse gidda gelii sa7appa eeratsi gidda shiishode fana oocida. Yeyzi, ye gonggizella afa bettii asuntsana tamaarssida.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Fa tamaarssizanno hyaasidanippa suuba Simoonago, «Gode geenttigo shiishii molo aykkodes yin gitiza olote» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simoona mahi, «Asttamaarizayo, qamma kumutsi labbii aqii akkon aykkikaaya, yezin ne gayko gitiza oloda» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:3">Waha. 21:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Un gitiza olide wode gitize fedhinttode wontsis gaama molo aykkida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:6">Waha. 21:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Melle gongge yeze fa lagguntsi yi7i, fana maaddode gaar wuttii xeegida. Un yi7i lam77i gonggita, hyaatsite qoodhinttode wontsis molora kuntsida.<verse eid="LUK 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Simoon Phexiroosa yinno be7eze wode Yesuusa tiintte bunqqunttii, «Laatstso, taanii nagarar yeze as maaqqide gisho taappa hyaakko» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Yinno E ga7idanna ezin eera yezuntsi aykkide molo gaamatitsite gaama qoppide gisho. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Mahi Simoona zhame maaqqide Zabdoosa na7untsi Yayqoobaran Wahannisaran gaama qoppida. Yesuusa Simoonago, «Zhashtippe! Yikkeppa neenii as aykkize asi maaqqada» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Un gonggito gaxa shiishidannippa suuba ubbanno ashshii Yesuusa kaallida.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa qursuma hyargginttiza fatstsida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Maato. 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar. 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Yesuusa katamuntsappa fete gidda yezin fettii qursuma hyarggera<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Qursuma hyargge: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Qursuma hyargge as gallalla afa kezize hyargge. Isra7eele sa7a qursumara hyargginttizuntsi melle asappa dummudhii yenep attin asara yellinttoos.</char></note> aykkinttide asi yinna katamite yene. Ye atstsay Yesuusa bi7i E tiintte bunqqunttii, «Laatstso, ne qofa maaqqiko tana geeshodes dandda7ane» ga7i woossida.<verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Yesuusa fa kushito dakkii bochchii, «Yee, ta qofa; geezho» yagayda. Izira qursuma hyarggize atstsa dakkida.<verse eid="LUK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Yesuusa, «Hyanno oodesin ohippe, yezin hyanggi ne galtto kahinze beezo. Ne geezhidannis markka maaqqade fana Muse kiittide zharshito zharsho» ga7i kiittida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Leewe 14:1-32</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Maaqqo yezin, Yesuusa suntsita kasennippa aadhii dalggitera hyanggida. Gaama asuntsi E ohizanno si7odesin fa hyarggitippa faxodes ye7ine. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Yezin E gaama wode geema bessa qitii woossane.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa wobbo fatstsida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Maato. 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar. 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Fettii wode Yesuusa tamaarssodera Galilappan Yihuda kara gancce ubbappa mahi Yerusalaameppan ye7eze Farisaawuntsin higge asttamaaruntsi ize bettida. As fatstsize Laatstse wolqqitan eera yene. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Ye wode asuntsi fettii wobbo atstsa alggara tookkii ki7ida. Keetstsa geltsii E tiintte gaddodes qoppida. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Yezin as gaamappa denddii keetstsa geltsodes gamin keetstsalla afa kezii, keetstsi aafto qawuxii, hyargginttiza alggizera Yesuusa tiino ketstsida.<verse eid="LUK 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Yesuusa un ammantto bi7i, «Naate atstsayo, ne nagartta uccinttida» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Higge asttamaaruntsin Farisaawuntsi, «Hyay Xoozzella afa yaga7i ohize oode? Fettii Xoozzep attin melle nagara uccodes dandda7ize oode?» yaga7i qoppida.<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Yesuusa un qoftto eride gisho unttago, «Yin wozintte hyannii gaar akkos qoppete? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>‹Ne nagartta ucinttida ga7izanippan denddii qito ga7izannippa aaye foolle?› <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Yezin ta yinno gaydanna As Na7ay sa7alla afa nagara uccodes adetits wolqqa yezanno yin erode gaara.» Yinnippa kaallii, wobbo atstsa, «Denddo; ne alggiza tookkii ne kara qito» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>E iira denddii un tiintte eqqida; E tookkintti yi7ide alggiza tookkii Xooz galatitera fa kara qitida. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Ye wode ubbuntsi gaama qoppida. Xooz galatitera, «Hyayno damma kille baz bi7ida» yaga7i zhashtida.<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Leewe xeegida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Maato. 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar. 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa yeygappa kezii qitida. Leewe ga7inttize fettii qaraxe gachchizay qaraxe gachchize besite bettidaya bi7i, «Tana kaallo» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>E ubba baz ashshii denddii eza kaallida.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Ye Leewize fa kara damma diggisa giigizida. Gaama giira gachizuntsin melle asuntsi katstsa ma7ades bettida. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Farisaawuntsin higge asttamaaruntsi, «Giira gachizuntsaran nagaranchchuntsara akkos me7e uzhe?» yaga7i Yesuusa tamaaruntsalla afa zuuzinggida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1-2">Luqa. 15:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Hyargginttizuntsis fattin faxas akime koshshoos. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Taanii nagaranchchuntsana maarotitsago mahodes fattin geeshshuntsana xeegodes yi7ikaaya» yaga7i mahida.<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xooma bazis shiiqide ooce</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Un Yesuusago, «Wahannisa tamaaruntsi gaama wode xoomane, woossane; mahi Farisaawuntsi tamaaruntsin yinnii gaara yiizane. Yezin neesuntsi ubba wode muune uzhane» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Mushura unttara yezin xeeginttide asuntsi xoomode gaar yissades dandda7anete? <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Yezin mushurze unttappa shaakkinttode wode ye7oda, ye wode un xoomoda.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Mahi yaga7i aazize ohida; «Kille ma7oppa feedhii gal77a ma7olla afa sikkize ooden baaya. Yinnii fana yeyziko kille ma7iza feedhane, killize gal77izes giigoos. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Mal7antto woyne cima silphe gujjize ooden baaya. Yinno yeyziko, mal77antto woynize cima silphiza dhuussane; woynttan lanttane silphizen maaddoose baz maaqqane. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Yinnii gisho, mal7antto woyne kille silphe gujunttodes beezane. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Yikke, caalize lo77o gaaze gisho caala woyne uzhii maaqqii caalikaayza mal7antto koyze ooden baaya» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Sambbata baz oocinttida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Maato. 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar. 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Fettii Sambbata wode Yesuusa zarga gade giddara aadhane. Yesuusa tamaaruntsi tizha zarga duutsii fa kushite shiccii dha7ane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Mahe 23:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Yezin Farisaawuntsi giddappa fete fete, «Sambbata wode higges beezoosse baz akkos oochche?» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Yesuusa unttago mahi, «Dawute naydhdhide wode faara yezuntsara wolla oochchidanno nabbabika?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam. 21:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>Xoozze keetstsa gelii Ayhude kahinuntsi xalaalasin Xoozis beezze daabbuto mu7ida; faara yezuntsisin inggida» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Leewe 24:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Mahi Yesuusa, «As Na7ay Sambbata Laatstsi» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Melle Sambbata qamma Yesuusa Ayhude woosa keetstsa gelii tamaarssida. Yinna besite mizaqi kushe gunddide fettii asi yene.<verse eid="LUK 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Higge asttamaaruntsin Farisaawuntsin eza mootodes oge koyi Sambbata wode fatstsiko be7ada ga7i kafane. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Yezin Yesuusa un qoftto erii kushe gunddide atstsego, «Denddii asunts gidda eqqo» yagayda. Atstsayin denddii eqqida.<verse eid="LUK 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Yesuusa, «Ane ta yinttana fettibaz oocane; Sambbata qamma higgite oochchodes beezizanna lo77o bazone iita bazo? Shemppo ashshene woy dhabsse?» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Mahi Yesuusa E kale wutii yeze asuntsana ubba wututsi bi7i atstsego, «Ne kushito fiddii yiizo» yagayda. Atstsayin E gayidanni gaara yeyzin kushize faxida. <verse eid="LUK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Yezin higge asttamaaruntsin Farisaawuntsin gaama zhilidhdhida. Yesuusalla afa akko oochcho ga7i fa gidda zorinttida.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa taphpho lam77i hawaaruntsana doorida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Maato. 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar. 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Ye wode yinna qammitippa fete gidda Yesuusa woossodes derella afa kezida. Qamma kumutsi Xooz woossittera aqida. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Wonttistto fa tamaaruntsana xeegii un giddappa taphpho lam77untsana doorii, unttana, «Hawaaruntsana» ga7i suntsida. <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Unttin, Phexiroosa ga7i suntside Simoona, E ishe Inddirase, Yayqooba, Wahannisa, Filphoosa, Bartolomiyoosa, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Maatoosa, Toomaasa, Ilfiyoosa na7a Yayqooba, fa gaditis qana7ize Simoona, <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Yayqooba na7a Yihudan Yesuusa aatsii inggide Asqorootu Yihuda.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa tamaarssidannon fatstsidanno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Yesuusa Hawaaruntsara wolla derizeppa wodhdhii ganas bessa eqqida. E tamaaruntsappa gaamuntsi yinna besite yene Yihuda sa7a ubbappa Yerusalaameppa, Xiroosappan Sidoona abba gaxappa yi7ide gaama asuntsi yene. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Un yi7idanna E tamaarssizebaz si7odesin fa hyarggitippa faxodes. Tuna ayyaanara waayinttize asuntsin faxida. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Wolqqa eeppa kezii asuntsana ubba fatstsize gisho asuntsi eza bochchodes koyane.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ufayssin azzanon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Fa tamaaruntsago bi7i hyannigaara yagayda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">«Hyantseso, dahuntso, yin anjjinttiduntsana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">Xoozze ka7itumo yinttis.<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Yin hyatte naydhdhizuntsi anjjinttiduntsana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">yin mishshada.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Yin hyatte yeekkizuntsi anjjinttiduntsana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">yin miicoda.<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>Asi yinttana ta gisho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">ixxize wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">yinttana shaakkize wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">yinttana un toochize wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">iita suntsi un yinttis inggize wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">yin anjjinttiduntsana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 4:14">Aazi. 4:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>«Yikke, yin anjjita salo damma maaqqide gisho ye wode ufayssara dollote. Akkos gayko, zaga un aduntsi nabuntsalla afa yinnii gaar oochchida»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2 Zeena 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Hawa. 7:52</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>«Yezin dure asuntso yinttana bade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">yin hyatte lo77o yestto ekkida.<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Hyatte mizhiduntso yinttana bade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">yin naydhdhoda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Hyatte miicizuntso yinttana bade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">yin kaydhdhoda yeekkoda.<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>Asi ubbuntsi yin lo77otitsito xalaala ohize wode yinttana bade.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">Un aduntsi zaga worddo nabuntsalla afa yinnii gaar oochchida.<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yin morkkuntsana kadhote</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Maato. 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>«Yezin tana si7ize yinttis ta ohine; yin morkkuntsana kadhote; yinttana ixxizuntsis lo77o baz oochchote. <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>Yinttana baaddizuntsana anjjote, yinttana qohizuntsis woossote. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Fettii zala dhookiza baqqiko hyankko zalza beezo. Ne kootiza ekkoda gaazes ne shaamizayan gujjii inggo. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Nena woossize ubbuntsis inggo; neeppa ekkiza ooden maho ga7i oocippe. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Asuntsi yinttis oochchode gaar yin koyzanni fana yinttin asuntsis oochchote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:17">Maato. 7:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>«Yin yinttana kadhize asuntsana xalaala kadhiko, akko galata yinttis yeze? Melle atto yezin, nagaranchchuntsin fana kadhizuntsana kadhane. <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Yinttis lo77o baz oochchizuntsis xalaala lo77o baz oochchiko yinttis akko galata yeze? Nagaranchchuntsin yinnii gaara oochchane. <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Tal77e mahode asuntsis xalaala yin tal77iko akko dumma galata yeze? Nagaranchchuntsin suub mahode as bi7i tal7ane.»<verse eid="LUK 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>«Yezin yin morkkuntsana kadhote; unttis lo77o baz oochchote. Suuba ekkodes qoppikaayzara tal77ote. Yinne yin ekkode anjjita damma maaqqada. Yin Ubbappa kattara yeze Xoozze na7untsana maaqqada. E fana galatosuntsisin iituntsisin dalgga. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Yin salo aday maariza maaqqidanni gaara yinttin maarizuntsana maaqqote.<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Melluntsalla afa firddippete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>«Asalla firddippete; yinttalla afa firddinttoos. Yin borinttaame fana oonan borippete. Atto ga7ote; Xoozii yinttis atto ga7oda. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Inggote; yinttis ingginttoda. Yin makkidanne yinttis mahi makkinttoda, lo77o makkize bazite baqqii, kumutsi, lanttode wontsis yinttis makinttii ingginttoda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Manin Yesuusa yaga7i unttis aazize ohida; «Qooqize qooqe kaalitsodes dandda7ane? Kaalitsiko lam77untsi wol ekkii gaga qitosaane?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:14">Maato. 15:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Tamaare asttamaareppa aadhoos. Yiikon loytsii tamaaride atstse fa asttamaarize fana yi7ane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24-25">Maato. 10:24-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Waha. 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>«Ne ishe aafte yeze buuriza akkos be7e? Ne aafte yeze tuusi fana yeza akkos bo7osa? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Ne aafte yeze tuusi fana yeza bi7ikaayzara ne ishego, ‹Ta ishayo ne aafte yeze buuriza kesso› ga7odes wayzi dandda7e? Hyay cubbuzayo, tiinidhii ne aafte yeze tuusi fana yeza kesso. Yinnippa suuba, ne ishe aafte yeze buuriza kessodes geeshi be7ada.<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Minxan E aafizan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>«Lo77o minxa iita aafe aafoos; yinnii gaara iita minxa lo77o aafe aafoos. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Aafe aafize minxa ubbanna fa aafte erinttane. Anggatsappa belese minxa aafe maxinttoos mahi hyalimoppa woyne aafe maxinttoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Maato. 12:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Lo77o asi fa wozintte kumide lo77o baztippa lo77o baz kessane. Iita asi fa wozintte kumide iita bazitippa iita baz kessane. Asi fa wozintte kumii tirfide bazappa fa doonara ohine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:34">12:34</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Keetstsi keexize lam77i asuntsana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Maato. 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>«Ta gaazanno yin oochchoos, yezara yeezin akkos tana, ‹Laatstso, Laatstso, ga7ete?› <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Taago ye7izen ta qaaltto si7i folize ubbuntsi oona aazizako ta yinttana beessada. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>E keetstsi keexxodes ziqqii yiizii, olla bookkide, oomora yeze lallalla afa keetstsi esside cincca atstsa aazane. Hyaro goggii ye keetstsa urqqida, yezin mintsii keexide gisho en7isades dandda7ikaaya. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Yezin ta qaaltto si7i oochchoose fa keetstsito shafella afa baasikaayzara keexxide atstsa aazane. Hyaro goggii ye keetstsa urqqide wode ellisii gol7ida. Ye keetstsize damma gol7e gol7ida» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Fettii Roome Mato hyalaqize ammano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Maato. 8:5-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:43-54">Waha. 4:43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Yesuusa yinno ubba asuntsi tiino tamaarssi hyaasidanippa suuba, Qifirnahoome katama qitida. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Yinna besite fettii Roome mato hyalaqa yene. E gaama kadhize arize hyargginttii hyayqos yellida. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>E Yesuusa baz si7ide wode fa ariza fatstsode fana eza woosso ga7i fettii fettii Ayhude cimuntsana Yesuusago kiittida. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Kiitinttiduntsi, Yesuusago hyanggi, «Ne ees hyanno oochchodes beezane. <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>Akkos gayko, hyay atstsay nu asuntsana kadhane, Ayhude woosa Keetstsin keexxida» yaga7i mintsii woossida <verse eid="LUK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Yesuusan unttara hyanggida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">Mato hyalaqize karago ukkide wode fa lagguntsana eego kiittii, «Laatstso, ta keetstsa ne gelodes beezoosse gisho labbippe. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Taanin tana ne tiintte shiiqodes beezze asi ga7i qoppoos. Yezin ne fettii qaala oho; ta arize faxoda. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Taas taappa kattara hyalaqa yene, taappa yeekkara ta kiittize wottaddaruntsi yene. Feta, ‹Qito› gayko qitane, hyankaya, ‹Yo7o› gayko ye7ine. Ta arizego, ‹Hyanno yiizo› gayko yiizane» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Yesuusa yinno si7ide wode gaama qoppida. Suub maaqqii fana kaallize asuntsago, «Ta yinttis turo ohine; melle atto yezin Isra7eeluntsappan hyannii gaar damma ammano denggikaaya» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Kiitinttiduntsi kara maaqqide wode arize faxin denggida.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Budantti na7a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Eeratsi wodeppa suuba Yesuusa Nayne katama qitida. E tamaaruntsaran melle gaama asuntsi eera qitida. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>E katama gelodes yi7ize wode aha tookkii gaama asi katamappa kezane. Hyayqqide na7ay fa inttis fetto, izan budano maaqqii yene. Katama asuntsappa gaamuntsi iira yene. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Laatstsii izo bi7i yiqsinttii, «Yeekkippe» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Shiiqii shanchafiza bochchin tookkide asuntsi eqqida. Yesuusa, «Naate, na7atitsayo denddo» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Hyayqqiday denddii bettii ohe aykkida. Yesuusa na7aya dentsii inttis inggida.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Asuntsi ubbuntsi zhashtii, «Damma nabe nu gidda denddida; Xoozii fa asuntsana bi7ida» yaga7i Xooz galatida. <verse eid="LUK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>E suntsita Yihudan yinna kara gancce yeze sa7ite ubbanne sinttida.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusan Xammaqize Wahannisan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Xammaqize Wahannisa tamaaruntsi yinno ubbanno Wahannisas ohida. E un giddappa lam77untsana xeegii, <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>«Yo7oda ga7inttide nenane? Woy melle naagode?» yaga7i oocote ga7i Laatstsago kiittida.<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Asuntsi Yesuusago hyanggi, Xammaqize Wahannisa, «Yo7oda ga7inttide nenane? Woy melle naagode?» ga7ote ga7i nuna neego kiittida yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Yinna saate Yesuusa gaama asuntsana hyarggeppa fatstsida. Gaama tuna ayyaanuntsana kessida, qooqide aafen bi7izida. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Wahannisa kaleppa kiitinttii ye7ezuntsago, «Hyanggi yin bi7idannon si7idannon Wahannisas ohote. Aafe qooquntsi be7ada, tohe gundduntsi billinttii yedhdhoda, qursumara hyarggnttizuntsi faxoda, tulluntsi si7oda, hyayqqiduntsi hyayqoppa denddoda, dahuntsis Wonggele sabbakinttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5-6">Isa. 35:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Ta gidda dhubunttoosse ooden anjjinttidaya.»<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Wahannisa kiittiduntsi qitidannippa suuba Yesuusa asuntsis Wahannisa baz yaga7i ohida: «Yin akko be7ades akko baayze ganasa kezido? Baqo en7isize shombboqo be7adesine? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Yeezin, akko be7ades kezido? Bonchcho ma7o ma77ide asuntsana be7adesine? Bonchcho ma7o ma77iduntsin sa7a lo77ide asuntsi kaati keetstsa yene. <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Yeezin, akko be7ades kezido? Nabe be7adesine? Yee, ta yagaane: yin be7ades kezidanna nabeppa aadhizaya.<verse eid="LUK 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>« ‹Ne ogito ne tiintte giigize</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">ta Kiitanchchiza neeppa tiino ta kiittoda›<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mil. 3:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 7:27">ga7intti xaafinttidanna yinnisi. <verse eid="LUK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Ta yinttis ohine; maachippa yelinttiduntsi giddappa Wahannisappa aadhize baaya. Xoozze ka7itumtte ubbappa eerizay, E ubbappa damma maaqqada» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Melle atto yezin, giira gachchizuntsii ubbuntsi Wahannisa kushite xammaqinttiduntsi Yesuusa qaaltto si7i Xoozii xillo maaqqidanno qonccizida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:32">Maato. 21:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luqa. 3:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Yezin Farisaawuntsin higge asttamaaruntsi Wahannisa kushite xammqinttanxxi Xoozze zortto leqqida.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Yesuusa kaallii hyannigaara yagayda: «Yikke, hyanna wode yeletuntsana akkora aazizo? Unttin oona aazane yessa? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Gabe gidda bettii wol xeegii, ‹Nu yinttis suulunqe fuggin, yin yexxoos. Nu nashshii gayrin, yin yeekkoos› yagaaze na7untsana aazane. <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Xammaqize Wahannisa mu7ikaayzaran uzhikaayzara yi7in, ‹Iita ayyaanara yene gayda.› <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>As Na7ay mu7iteran woyne uzhittera yi7in, hyay atstse ‹Muus zhimbbaran ushi asi, giira gachchuzuntsisin nagaranchchuntsi zhame› gayda. <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Yikke, Xoozze cinccatitsi oochara qonccida».<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fettii maachita Yesuusa shitto tizhida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Fettii Farisaawize Yesuusa katstsa muussades fa kara xeegida. E Farisaawize kara hyanggi leemate kale bettida. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Yinna katamite fettii nagaranchcho maacha yezanna Yesuusa Farisaawize kara muusalla afa yezanno si7ide wode gaama al77o Albasxiroose bilqqaaxe shitto ekkii yi7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37-38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:7">Maato. 26:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3">Mar. 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:3">Waha. 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Yesuusas suuba zalara, iza tohiti kale eqqii yeekkitera iza tohito fa afutsitira laakitsane. Fa ommitira iza tohito ucciteran yeerite shitto tizhida.<verse eid="LUK 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Mu7ize bazito giigizide Farisaawize yinno be7eze wode fa wozintte, «Hyayni nabe yezako hyanna maachita eza bochchizanna oode yezako mahi iza nagara de7or maaqqidanno E erod yeshsha» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Yesuusa, «Simoona, ta nees ohize baz yene» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Ezin, «Asttamaarizayo, taas oho» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Yesuusa eego, «Lam77i asuntsi fettii atstseppa bira tal77ida. Fete ichchin xeeti bira hyankay mahi ishintam bira tal77ida. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Lam77untsin tal77ito ciggodes gamin, lam77untsisin tal77ito maarida. Yikke, hyantsi lam77untsappa ye atstsa gaama kadhode nees aaya aaze» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simoona, «Gaama gale atto ga7inttide atstse gaama kadhoda aazane» yagayda. Yesuusa, «Ne turo firddida» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa maachitigo maaqqii bi7i, Simoonago, «Hyanno maachito be7ine? Taanii ne kara gelin melle attin ne taas tohe hyaatsi inggikaaya, yezin iza ta tohito fa afutsitira laakitsii fa ommitira uccida. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Ne tana yeerii biikaaya, yezin iza ta ne kara gelidannippa aykkii ta tohito yeere ashshikaaya. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Ne ta ommite zayte tizhikaaya, yezin iza ta tohito shitto tizhane. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Iza tana gaama kadhide gisho I gaama nagartta atto ga7inttida. E eerats nagartta atto ga7inttide eeratsi kadhane.»<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Yesuusa maachitigo, «Ne nagartta atto ga7inttida» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Ezara wolla leemate bettii mu7ize zaqquntsi, «Nagara atto gayde, E hyayni oode?» yaga7i fa wozintte qoppida.<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Yesuusa maachitigo, «Ne ammantta nena ashshida; saro qito» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa mokkide maachuntsana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa Xoozze ka7itumo Wonggele sabbakitera katamaran kara ganccera aadhida. Ye wode taphpho lam77untsin eera yene. <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>Maaqqii tuna ayyaanappan dumma dumma hyarggeppa faxide fettii fettii maachuntsi eera yene. Unttin, laappun tuna ayyaanuntsi kezide Magdela Mayramo,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:55-56">Maato. 27:55-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:40-41">Mar. 15:40-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:49">Luqa. 23:49</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Heroodisa shuumide Kuuza machchito Yohaanna, Soosinaran mahi melle gaamuntsi unttana birara maaddizuntsi yene.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Budutsi aazize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Gaama asuntsi dumma dumma katamappa eego shiiqin aazizera unttis ohida. <verse eid="LUK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>«Fettii wooti aqizay budutsi budodes kezida. E budodera fettii fettii budutsita ogella wodhdhii yedhdhinttida, Landda maxida. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Melluntsi lalla oomora yeze sa7alla afa wodhdhida. Hyaga dolodera sa7ite laako baayze gisho miccida. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Melle budutsita mahi anggatsi gidda wodhdhida. Anggatstira wolla diccide gisho anggatsita cuullii besite ashshida. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Melluntsi lo77o sa7alla afa wodhdhida. Dolide wode xeeti kushe aafida.» Yinno ohi hyaasii, fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Si7ize hyaye yeze ubbuntsi si7o» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Budutsi aaziztis bilitsii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>E tamaaruntsi, «Hyanna aaziztis bilitsita akko?» yaga7i oocida <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>E, «Xoozze ka7itumo gaatsi qofa erode fana yinttis ingginttida. Yezin melluntsi bi7ite denggaame gaar, si7ite tiiraame gaar aazizera ohine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isa. 6:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Budutsi bilitsito qonccize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>«Yikke, hyanna aazizitis bilitsita hyanno: budutsi ga7inttide Xoozze qaala. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Ogella wodhdhide budutsita qaala si7izuntsana. Maaqqo yezin, un ammanii attaame fana Xalahe qaaltto un wozinttippa maxii hyaasane. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Lalla oomo yeze sa7alla afa wodhdhide budutsita qaala si7i ufayssara ekkizuntsana. Un hyattes ammananep attin xapho baayze gisho faatana yellide wode ellisii kaaddane. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Anggats gidda budunttezuntsi qaala si7izuntsana. Unttin alame qofara, duretitsara sa7a yessi giigara cuulunttii koshshize fana aafikaay. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Lo77o sa7alla wodhdhide budutsita lo77o wozinara qaala si7i naagizuntsanan dandda7ara miinggi aafe aafizuntsana.<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Qoncce yeze xomppe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>«Xomppe xomppii, kurkuro guphii woy datsappa oomora gaddize baaya. Gelize asi be7ade gaar dhoqqa bessa gaddane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:15">Maato. 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Luqa. 11:33</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>«Yinnii gisho, aachinttide qoncce kezikaayzara geenggide geesha kezikaayzara attode baz baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Maato. 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Luqa. 12:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>«Yikke, yin qaala wayzi si7izako tiirote. Yeze ubbuntsis gujintti ingginttoda, baayzes melle atto yezin ees yeze eeratsitan eeppa ekinttoda» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:29">Maato. 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Luqa. 19:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa inttiran ishuntsara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Maato. 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar. 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Yesuusa inttiran ishuntsara eego yi7ida. Yezin as gaamatitsappa denddi eza denggodes dandda7ikaaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Fettii asi Yesuusago, «Ne inttiran ne ishuntsara nena koyi bale kafane» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Xoozze qaala si7i oochalla feeshizuntsi ubba taas inddon taas ishen» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa hyaatsi zuluntto seerida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Maato. 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar. 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Fettii wode Yesuusaran E tamaaruntsara wolla gongge gelii, Abba fiinggoda yagayda. Unttin qitodes denddida. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Abballa afa un fiinggodes hyammadera Yesuusa genttida. Tiirikaayzin mintsii baqo abballa denddida. Hyaatsita gonggite gelin gonggize qoodhintte aykkide wode ubbuntsi zhashtida.<verse eid="LUK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>E tamaaruntsi eego shiiqii, «Nu Laatstsayo, nu Laatstsayo, nu dhabane yaga7i» Yesuusa dentsida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yesuusa denddii baqiton zuluntton kaccida. Ellisii baqitan zulunttan woppu gayda. Sarotitsin maaqqida. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsago, «Yin ammantta ane» yagayda. Unttin, zhashtiteran gaama qopitera fete fetego, «Baqqon hyaatsin kiitinttize, E hyay oode» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuna ayyaanappa dakinttide atstsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Maato. 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mar. 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Abba fiinggi Galila zalara yeze Gerggesoone sa7a yellida. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Yesuusa gonggeppa kezii sa7a wodhdhodera tuna ayyaanara aykkinttide atstse katamappa kezii eera yellinttida. Gaama bere afula ma77anxi kallo booza yenep attin kara geloos. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Yesuusa be7eze wode E tiintte bunqqunttii, fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Ubbappa kattara yeze Xoozze na7ayo Yesuusa neera taas akko fettetitsi yeze? Aade tana hyatte un7itsippe» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Yinno E gaydanna, tuna ayyaanze atstseppa kessade gaar Yesuusa kaccide gisho. Gaama wode tuna ayyaana eza aykkii gam7ide gisho santsalaataran tohe accize meqora acinttii naaginttane. Yezin achito duutsii tuna ayyaanara izhintti akko baayze ganasa gelida.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Yesuusa, «Ne suntsita oode» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">E, gaama tuna ayyaanuntsi eza aykkide gisho fana, «Leegiyona» gayda. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Tuna ayyaanuntsi fana Si7oole kiittaame fana woossida.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Yinna besite zoozella afa mu7ize gudayille wude hyanttane. Seko gudayluntsi gidda gelone ga7i woossida, ezin «Gelote» gayda. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Tuna ayyaanuntsi atstseppa kezii gudayluntsi gidda gelida. Wudita derttippa sulle gurgguxii abba geenna gidda qoodhdhinttida.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Yenggizuntsi hyanidanno be7eze wode woxxii hyanggi, katamaran kara gancce ubba ohida. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Asuntsi hyanidanno be7ades kezii Yesuusago yi7ida. Tuna ayyaana kezide atstse ma7o ma77i, E wozintta maaqqin, Yesuusa tohe kale bettezin denggi zhashtida. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Eza be7eze asuntsi tuna ayyaanara aykkinttide atstse wayzi faxezako ohida. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Gerggesoone kantto wutii yeze asuntsi damma zhashimo zhashtii Yesuusa fa kaleppa qitode gaar woossida. E gonggize gidda gelii suub maaqqida.<verse eid="LUK 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Tuna ayyaana kezide atstse Yesuusara yessades woossida. <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>Yezin Yesuusa eego, «Ne kara maaqqo, Xoozii akko gaar damma baz nees oochchezako oho» yaga7i moyzida. Atstsayin Yesuusa akko gaar damma baz ees oochchezako katama ubba markkidhite qitida.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hyayqqide na7iton Yesuusa ma7o bochchide maachito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Maato. 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar. 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Asuntsi naagii gam77ide gisho Yesuusa maaqqide wode mokkii ekkida. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Ayhude woosa Keetstsa hyalaqa maaqqide Iyaroosa gaaze atstse fa kara ye7ode fana Yesuusa tohitilla afa wodhdhii woossida. <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>Ees taphpho lam77i bere maaqqide fettii maachi na7a yezanna hyarginttii hyayqos yellii yene. Yesuusa hyanggize wode asuntsi eza un7itsida. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Taphpho lam77i bere suutsii eqqanxxi goggitera gam7ide maacha yene. Iza faas yeze miishito akimes inggi hyaasida. Yezin Faxodes dandda7ikaaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Iza Yesuusas suub zalara shiiqii, E afula macartto bochchida, iira goggize suutsita eqqida.<verse eid="LUK 8:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Yesuusa, «Tana bochchide oode?» yagayda. Ubbuntsi «Nu bochchikaaya» yaga7in, Phexiroosa, «Asttamaarizayo, gaama asuntsi kaallizannon un7itsizanno bi7itera wayzi, [‹Tana bochcheze oode?› ga7e»] yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Yezin Yesuusa, «Fettii asi tana bochchida; akkos gayko, wolqqa taappa kezidanna taas erinttida» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 8:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Maachita, I baz qonccidanno eride wode goqitera yi7i Yesuusa tohitilla afa gol7ida. Akkos bochchezakon wayzi ellisii faxezako as ubba tiino markkidhida. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>E, «Ta na7ite, ne ammantta nena fatstsida; sarora qito» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Yesuusa hyaga ohi hyaasikaayzin, Ayhude woosa Keetstsa hyalaqa, Iyaroosa karappa fettii asi yi7i, «Iyaroosa, ne na7ita hyayqqida; asttamaariza hyarii labbizippe» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Yezin Yesuusa yinno si7i Iyaroosago, «Zhashtippe! Ammano, ne na7ita faxoda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Yesuusa Iyaroosa kara yellide wode Phexiroosappa, Wahannisappa, Yayqoobappa, naatii adeppan inttippa attin melle gelode gaar koykaaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Yinna besite yeze asunts ubbuntsi naatis yiqsinttii yeekkoder, Yesuusa, «Yeekkippete! Naata genttidap attin hyayqqikaaya» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Asuntsi naata hyayqqidanno eride gisho E ohito leqqii miicida. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Yezin Yesuusa naatii kushito aykkii, «Na7ite denddo» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Na7itis shemppita yi7in denddii eqqida. Yesuusa unttago, «Iis muuze baz inggote» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Naatii aderan inttira gaama qoppida. Yezin Yesuusa hyanno, «Oodesin ohippete» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa taphpho lam77i hawaaruntsana kiittida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Maato. 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mar. 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Yesuusa taphpho lam77i hawaaruntsana faago xeegii, tuna ayyaana kessode gaaran hyargge ubba fatstsode gaar wolqqan adetits wolqqa inggida. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Xoozze ka7itumo baz markkidhade fana hyargginttizuntsana fatstsode fana kiittida. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>E unttago, «Gufe maaqqin silphe maaqqin katstsa maaqqin bira maaqqin lam77i ma7ize afula maaqqin oges ga7i akkon aykkippete.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Luqa. 10:4-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Yinna katamttippa yin kessade wontsis zaqqotitsi yin gelide bessa gam7ote. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>Ooden yinttana mokkanxi ixxiko yinna katamttippa kezitera unttis ersize markka maaqqade fana yin tohite yeze xurtto fixxii kezote.» <verse eid="LUK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Unttin kiitinttidanni fana kezii Wonggele ohitera dumma dumma kara gancce hyargganchuntsana fatstsitera aadhida.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Heroodisa yirggida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Galila sa7a ahize Heroodisa Yesuusara oochinttidebazito mulo si7eze wode yirggida. Akkos gayko, fettii fettii asuntsi Wahannisa hyayqoppa denddikaayzara attaama yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:14">Maato. 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mar. 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Luqa. 9:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Bagguntsi, «Eeliyaasa benttida» gaane; melluntsi mahi, «Zaga nabuntsappa fete hyayqoppa denddida» yaga7i ohinttane. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Yezin Heroodisa, «Wahannisa afurtto ta gachchizii wodhida. Yeezin, hyannigaara yaga7intti E baz ohinttize, E oode?» yaga7i Yesuusa fa aafte be7ades koyane.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa ichchin mukul asuntsana muuzida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Maato. 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar. 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Waha. 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Taphpho lam77i hawaaruntsi suuba maaqqii yi7i, un oochchidanno mulo Yesuusas ohida. E unttana ekkii Beetesayda katamappa gaxa kanggida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Yezin gaama asuntsi Yesuusa maaqqizanno erii eza kaallida. E unttana mokkii ekkii Xoozze ka7itumo baz tamaarssida; Faxodes koyzuntsana fatstsida.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Sa7a uguride wode taphpho lam77i hawaaruntsi eego shiiqii, «Nu yeze akko baayze sa7a maaqqide gisho asuntsi dumma dumma kara ganccen kataman qitii, katstsan aqize bessi koyode fana asuntsana moyzo» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Yezin E, «Unttis muuze baz yin inggote» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Un, «Nuus yeze ichchin booran lam77i molon maaqqide gisho hyantsi asuntsis maaqqize katstsa nuunii hyanggi wongganxiko maaqqoos» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Yinna besite ichchin mukul maaqqade dhiiratsuntsii yene.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsago, «Ichintam ichintam shaakkii shaakkii asuntsana betitsote» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>E tamaaruntsi, E kiittidanni fana asuntsana betitsida. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>E ichchin booriton lam77i moltto ekkii, Salo bi7i, Xooz galatii, baxxi asuntsana mulo yeltsode fana fa tamaaruntsis inggida. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Ubbuntsi mu7i mizhida. Unttappa attide taphpho lam77i leemate kumutsi maaqqida.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiroosa, Yesuusa oode yezako markkidhida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Maato. 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mar. 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Fettii wode Yesuusa fa xalaala woossodera, E tamaaruntsi eego yi7ida. E, «Asuntsi tana oona ga7e?» ga7i oocida.<verse eid="LUK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Un mahi «Fete fete, ‹Xammaqize Wahannisa, bagguntsi Eeliyaasa, melluntsi mahi, zaga nabuntsappa fete hyayqoppa denddida› yagaane» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:1">Maato. 14:1</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-15">Mar. 6:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-8">Luqa. 9:7-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>E mahi, «Yeezin yin tana oona ga7e» yagayda. Phexiroosa, «Neenii Xoozappa doorinttide Kiristtoosa» yaga7i mahida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:68">Waha. 6:68</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 6:69">69</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Yesuusa hyanno oodesin ohippete ga7i mintsii ohida.<verse eid="LUK 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa ixintton eza kaalle waaga ciggizanno</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Mahin Yesuusa, «As Na7ay gaama madha ekkoda. Gade cimuntsis, kahinunts hyalaquntsisin, higge asttamaarunts kale ixinttoda. Un eza wodhoda, yezin E hyaydzintsa qamma hyayqoppa denddoda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Yesuusa asunts ubbuntsago, «Tana kaallodes koyze ooden yeziko fana kaaddo, fa masqaltto ubba qamma tookkii tana kaallo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Maato. 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luqa. 14:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Fa shemppito ashshodes koyze ubbuntsi izo dhabssane, fa shemppito ta gisho ga7i dhabsize ooden izo ashshane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Maato. 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luqa. 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Waha. 12:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Asi alame mulobaz denggiza, maaqqikon fa shemppito dhabsize baz woy qohize baz maaqqiko eza akko maadde? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Ooden ta giddan ta qaaltten yeellidhiko As Na7ay fa bonchchora yinnii gaara aday bonchchoran Geeshi kiitanchchuntsi bonchchora ye7ize wode ize yeellidhoda. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Ta yinttis turo ohine; hyanne eqqiduntsi giddappa Xoozze ka7itumo bi7ikaayzara hyayqqoosse asuntsi yene» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa bishshita laaminttida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Maato. 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mar. 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Yesuusa yinna ohito ohin, osfun qammappa suuba Phexiroosa, Yayqooban Wahannisan faara ekkii woossodes derella afa kezida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28-35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:17-18">2 Phex. 1:17-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>E woosalla afa yezin E sintta laaminttida; afulttan awa fana foo7i booxxida. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Lam77i asuntsi, unttin Museran Eliyaasara bonchchora benttii, <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>Yerusalaame folinttodes yeze baz, yinnan, E hyanna alamttippa shaakkinttode baz eera ohinttane. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Phexiroosan eera yezuntsi genttii attin, un genttoppa denddize wode E bonchchiton eera eqqide lam77i asuntsana bi7ida. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Asuntsi Yesuusappa shaakkintti qitodes yi7adera, Phexiroosa Yesuusago, «Laatstso, hyanne yezanna nuus akko gaar lo77o! Feta nees, feta Muses, feta Eliyaasas mahi hyaydzdzi gaabba gaabboda» gayda. Yezin E faas akko ga7ezakon eroos.<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>E yaga7i ohinttodera dhonne yi7i unttana goozida. Tamaaruntsi dhonttii gidda gelitera zhashtida. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Dhonne giddappa, «Ta dooride na7ay hyaya eza si7ote» yagaaze ootsii sinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa. 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Maato. 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar. 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luqa. 3:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Ye ootsize sinttidannippa suuba Yesuusa faas yezite benttida. Ye wode un bi7idanno oodesin ohikaayzara, fa wozintte aykkii si77i gayda.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa tuna ayyaana fettii na7appa kessida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Maato. 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mar. 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Wonttistto un derizeppa wodhdhize wode gaama asuntsi yi7i eera yellinttida. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Ye wode asunts giddappa fettii asi, «Asttamaarizayo, ta fettii na7aya yi7i bo7oyo. <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Tuna ayyaana qoppikaayzin aykkii wuysizane; goppuntto cooshi gudutstsane, ashito qohi un7itsi kessades koyoos. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Ne tamaaruntsi kessode gaar woossida, yezin un dandda7ikaaya» yaga7i woossida.<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Yesuusa, «Ammano baayze wobbo yeletuntso, ayde yellodes ta yinttara yessade, yinttana dandda7ode? Ne na7aya hyanggi hyanka ekkii yo7o» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Na7aya ekkii ye7ize wode tuna ayyaanze sa7a olii guuddii goqizida. Yezin Yesuusa tuna ayyaanza kaccii na7ayppa kessin fatstsida. Na7ayan na7ay ades inggida.<verse eid="LUK 9:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoozze damma oocha</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Asuntsi ubbuntsi Xoozze damma wolqqito bi7i gaama qoppida. Un E oochchide bazite gaama qoppodera, Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsago, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>«Hyanno ta yinttis ohizanno loytsii si7ote; As Na7ay Ayhuduntsi kushite aadhii ingginttoda» gayda. <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Yezin E gaydanna unttis gelikaayze gisho un tiirikaaya. Yinnii gisho, mahi oocodes zhashtida.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubbuntsappa damma maaqqade oode?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Maato. 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar. 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Yesuusa tamaaruntsi, «Nu gidda damma maaqqade oode?» ga7i lalle aykkida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luqa. 22:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Yesuusa un wozina qoftto erii zhooga na7a fa kale essi, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>«Hyay zhooga na7aya ta suntsite ekkize ooden tana ekkane, tana ekkize tana kiittezaya ekkane, yin ubbuntsappa eerizay, E damma maaqqada» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Maato. 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luqa. 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Waha. 13:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ixxoose yin bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Wahannisa, «Laatstso, fettii asi ne suntsite tuna ayyaana kessodera bi7i E nuura maaqqoosse gisho kayda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Yinttana ixxoose, E yin bagga. Yinnii gisho, eza kayppete» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Samaara asuntsi Yesuusa ixxida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Yesuusa Salo qitize wode ukkide gisho Yerusalaame qitodes qoftto mintsii denddida. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Samaara sa7a yeze fettii kara gancce hyanggitera, ubba baz ees giigisade fana asi yeyga kiittida. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Yezin E hyanggizanna Yerusalaame maaqqidanno un erize gisho un eza mokkii ekkikaaya. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Yesuusa tamaaruntsi Yayqoobaran Wahannisaran yinno bi7i, «Laatstso, saloppa tama wodhdhii unttana mo7o gawude fana ne koyane?» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:9-16">2 Kat. 1:9-16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Yezin Yesuusa suuba maaqqii unttana kaccii, [Yin gidda akko ayyaana yezako yin eroos. As Na7ay asi ashshodes yi7idap attin dhabsodes baaya]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Grike maxaafe gidda baaya</char></note> yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Yeygappa denddii melle kara gancce qitida.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa kaallizanna ciggizze waaga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Maato. 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Un ogera hyammadera, fettii asi, «Ne qitize bessa ubba ta kaalloda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Workkanas doochii, Landdas keetstsi yene, yezin As Na7ay fa ommito shemppize bessi baaya» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Hyankkayan, «Ne tana kaallo» yagayda. Yezin atstse, «Laatstso, tiinii ta adaya moogii ye7oda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Yezin Yesuusa, «Hyayqo yezuntsi hyayqqiduntsana moogode fana unttis ashshii ashsho; ne hyanggi Xoozze ka7itumo sabbako» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Mahi melle asi, «Laatstso, ta nena kaalloda, yezin tiinii ta kara asuntsana sarotsi ye7oda» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:61 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:20">1 Kat. 19:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Koxe aykkii suub bi7ize ooden Xoozze ka7itumos beezoos» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa laappuntam lam77i tamaaruntsana kiittida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Yinnippa suuba, Laatstsii melle laappun tam lam77i<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Laappun tam lam77i: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fettii fettii maxaafuntsi laappun tam gaane; mahi faydo 17 bo7o. </char></note> asuntsana doorida. E hyammades qoppide katamiten kara gancce ubba tiinii hyammade gaara lam77i lam77i mahi kiittida. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Yikke shiiqode katstsa gaama yezin oochchizuntsi eeratsi. Maaqqide gisho, katstsa laatstsay oochchizuntsana kiittode fana woossote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:37-38">Maato. 9:37-38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Yikke, qitote, duruntsi fana suudhumuntsi gidda yinttana ta dakkoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:16">Maato. 10:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>Yin qitize ogitis, bira maaqqikon karxite caamma aykkippete. Ogella afa ooden sarotsippete.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Maato. 10:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mar. 6:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Luqa. 9:3-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>Yin gelize keetstsa ubba tiinii, ‹Saro hyanna keetsitis maaqqe› yaga7ote. <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Saro kadhize asi yinna besite yeziko, yin sartta ize shemppoda; koyoos gayko yin sartta yinttis maaqqada. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>Oochchizes damooze beezze gisho yin gelide keetstsite yinttis shiishidebaz ubba mu7iteran uzhitera ize gam7ote. Fete karappa fete kara wutippete.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1 Qoro. 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:8">1 Ximo. 5:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Akko kataman yin gelize wode asuntsi yinttana mokkii, yinttis shiishidebaz ubba mo7ote. <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>Yinna katamite yeze hyargginttizuntsana fatstsitera, ‹Xoozze ka7itumo yinttago ukkida› yaga7i ohote. <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Yezin fettii katama gelize wode asuntsi yinttana mokkanxi ixxiko bucalla kezii hyannigaara ga7ote:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Hawa. 13:51</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>‹Nu tohitilla yeze yin katamiti xurtto fixxane, yezin Xoozze ka7itumo yinttago ukkidanno erote›<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Maato. 10:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mar. 6:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Luqa. 9:3-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Xoozze firdda qamma hyanna katamttippa Soodome katamas firdda eeratsi maaqqadanno ta yinttis ohine» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Medho 19:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:15">Maato. 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:24">11:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanoose gisho borinttide katamito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Maato. 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>Kaallii, Yesuusa, «Bade Koraaziine, bade Beetesayda, bade, yin gidda oochinttide kille bazita Xiroosa giddan Sidoonan oochinttezako ize yeze asuntsi azzano afula ma77i, budolla afa bettii zaga maarotitsi gelii attod yeshsha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Isa. 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-21">Hiz. 26:1-21</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Iyu. 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo. 1:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Zakka. 9:2-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Yinnii gisho, yinttappa aadhii Xiroosasin Sidoonasi Xoozze firddita laafoda. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>Bade Qifirnahoome, salo yellodes nena dhoqi oochchodes koyane? Ne sulle Si7oole olinttoda» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Isa. 14:13-15</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>Mahin Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsago, «Yinttana si7ize tana si7ine, yinttana ekkoosay tana ekkoos, tana ekkoosay tana kiittezaya ekkoos» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Maato. 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar. 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luqa. 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Waha. 13:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Laappuntam lam77untsi maaqqida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Laappuntam lam77i tamaaruntsi kiitinttide bestippa gaama ufayttitera maaqqida. Yesuusago shiiqii, «Laatstso, ne suntsite tuna ayyaanuntsin nuus kiitinttida» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Xalahe saloppa dada fana wodhdhodera ta bi7ida. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Yikke, shooshin masmaso yedhdhode fanan morkke wolqqa teqqode fana wolqqa yinttis inggida. Yinttana qohodebaz akkon baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 19:13">Maz. 19:13</ref></char></note><figure style="fig" alt="Scorpion" file="BK00058B.TIF" size="span" ref="10:19">Masmaso</figure> <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Maaqqikon, yin suntsita salo mazggabe xaafinttide gisho ufayttotep attin tuna ayyaanuntsi kiitinttide gisho ufayttippete» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fa ufayssito qonccizida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Maato. 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Ye wode Yesuusa Geeshi Ayyaanara ufaytti, «Salo sa7a Laatstso, hyanno cinccuntsappan eruntsappa aachchii tamaarikaayzuntsis qonccizide gisho galatintto. Yee ta adayo, yinno ne oochchodes lo77o qofa maaqqida.<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>«Ubba bazita ta adeppa taas ingginttida. Na7ay oode yezako adeppa attin melle woy na7ay qonccissades koyzeppa melle ooden adaya erize baaya» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Waha. 3:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Kaallii, Yesuusa dumma fa tamaaruntsago, «Yin be7izanno be7izuntsi anjjinttiduntsana. <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Turo gaama nabuntsin kaatuntsi yin be7izannon si7izanno be7adesin si7odes amudhdhida, yezin bi7ikaaya, si7ikaaya» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Turii siiqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Yikke, fettii wode Muse woga erize fettii atstse denddii Yesuusa yaga7i faatana oochi oocida. «Asttamaarizayo, medhina de7o laattodes taanii akko oochcho?» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25-28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:35-40">Maato. 22:35-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mar. 12:28-34</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Yesuusa, «Muse maxaafite xaafinttidanna waage? Ne wayzi nabbabe?» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Atstsay mahi, « ‹Ne Laatstsa ne Xoozza, ne kumutsi wozinappa, ne kumutsi shemppoppa, ne kumutsi wolqqappan ne kumutsi qofappa kadho. Mahi asi ne dootsiza ne ommiti gaar kadho› yagaane» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Leewe 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:5">Mahe 6:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Yesuusa eego, «Ne likke mahida, neenin yinnii gaara oochcho. Ne medhina de7o yessada» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Leewe 18:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Yezin atstse fana xillo mahodes koyi, «E ta dootsize oode?» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>E oocidannis Yesuusa yaga7i mahe inggida, «Fettii asi yezay Yerusalaame katamapa sulle Iyaarkko katama wodhodera ogella afa faanuntsi kezii guuddida. E ma7ito gaarii ekkii hyayqoppan faxappan gidda ashshii qitida. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Suubappa, Ayhude kahine fete yinna ogitira fa aadhe ga7i aadhittera atstsa bi7i deshshi ga7i aadhida. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Mahi fettii Leewe yezay yinna bestto yellittera atstsa bi7i melle bessara aadhii qitida. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Yezin, fettii Samaara gade asi yezay yinna ogitira yi7itera atstsa bi7i ees yiqsinttii<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33-34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:15">2 Zeena 28:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Eego shiiqii, E hyarggize bessitilla zayten woynen gujjii accida. Fa hyarizella bettitsii zaqqo aqize keetstsa kanggida. Yinna besite ees koshshize baz mulo oochchida. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Wonttistto lam77i dinaare kessii zaqqo mokkize karttii ades inggi, ‹Woy7a hyay atstsa loytsii bo7o. Ta nees inggidannippa kattara ne kesside baz mulo ta nees ciggoda› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>«Yikke, hyantsi hyaydzdzii asuntsappa faanuntsi guuddide atstses dootsidhade nees oona aaze?»<verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Atstsay mahi, «Ees yiqsinttidaya» gayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesuusa, «Neenin hyanggi yinnii gaara oochcho» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Marttan Mayrami keetstsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsara oge hyanggitera fettii kara gancce yellida. Yeyga Martta ga7inttize fettii maachita iza fa kara mokkida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38-39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:1">Waha. 11:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Iisin Mayramo gaaze misha yene, Mayrama qaala si7ite Laatstse tohe kale bettida. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Yezin Martta gaama oochara un77intti Yesuusago shiiqii, «Laatstso, ta mishta oochito ta xalaalas ashshii bettii attin ta labbize wode ne bi7itera si77i gaane? Iza tana maaddode fana ohoso» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Yezin Laatstsii hyannigaara ga7i mahida, «Martta, Martta, neenii gaamabazar un77intti madhidhane. <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>Maaqqikon, koshshize fettibaz xalaala. Mayrama lo77o baz doorida, yinnan iippa ekinttoos» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa woosa baz tamaarssida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Maato. 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Fettii wode Yesuusa fettii bessa woossane. Woosa hyaaside wode E tamaaruntsappa fete, «Laatstso, Wahannisa fa tamaaruntsana woosa tamaarsside fana neenin nuna woosa tamaarsso» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Yesuusa, «Hyannigaara yaga7i woossote:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">« ‹Salo yeze nu adayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">ne geeshi suntsita anjjintto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">ne ka7itumtta yo7o.<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Nu hyayno qumtto nuus inggo.<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Nuna qohiduntsis nu atto gaazanni fana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">nu nagartto atto ga7o;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">faatana gidda nuna geltsippe› » yagawute yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Kaalli, Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsago yagayda: «Aazizes yinttappa fetes lagge yene. E giddii bilahe fa dootsize kara hyanggi, ‹Dootso, hyaydzdzii soollo taas inggoya. <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>Taas lagge maaqqide fettii asi ogeppa yi7in, ees aatsodebaz dhabida› yagaazako,<verse eid="LUK 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>«E laggize keetstsa gidda yezara, ‹Aade tana waaytsippe, furtsita gorddinttida. Ta na7untsin taara datsalla afa woy7ida. Yinnii gisho, denddii ne koyizebaz immades dandda7oos› yagaanene? <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Ta yinttis ohine; laggetitsiti gisho denddii immades koyanxi ixxikon woosara waytside gisho denddii koshshize baz mulo inggane.<verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>«Yinnii gisho, taanii yinttis ohine; woossote yinttis ingginttoda; koyote yin demmada; furtstsa yi7i xeegote yinttis bugunttoda. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Akkos gayko woossize ubbuntsi ekkane; koyze denggane; furtstsa yi7i xeegizes bugunttane.<verse eid="LUK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>«Aduntso yin giddappa na7a molo woossin shooshi inggize oode? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Woy phuuphule woossin masmaso inggane? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Yin iituntsana maaqqii yin na7untsis lo77o baz ingge eriko, salo yeze yin aday woossizuntsis Geeshi Ayyaana wayzi aatsii inggoso?» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusan Bi7elzebuulan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Fettii wode Yesuusa doona muumizide tuna ayyaana fettii atstseppa kessida. Tuna ayyaanize kezide fana doona muume atstse ohinttida. Asuntsin gaama qoppida. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Yezin fete fete, «Tuna ayyaana hyalaqa, Bi7elzebuula wolqqara tuna ayyaanuntsana kessane» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Maato. 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Melluntsi mahi fattanodes saloppa malla beezode fana koyda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:38">Maato. 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1">16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mar. 8:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Yezin Yesuusa un qoftto erii unttago, «Wol gidda shaakkinttize ka7itumo ubbanna dhabane; wol gidda shaakkinttize keetstsi gol7ane. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Xalahe ka7itumo wol gidda shaakkinttiko wayzi miinggi eqqode? Yin tana, ‹E tuna ayyaanuntsana Bi7elzebuula wolqqara kessane› yagaane. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Yikke, taanii tuna ayyaana Bi7elzebuula wolqqara kessizebaz maaqqiko kaallizuntsi oode wolqqara kessod yeshsha? Yinnii gisho, un yinttalla afa firddizuntsna maaqqada. <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Yezin taanii tuna ayyaanuntsana Xoozze gil7ara kessizebaz maaqqiko yikke Xoozze ka7itumtta yinttago ukkidanno erote.<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>«Mintsii asi danccinttii fa keetsito naagizebaz maaqqiko, E qoltta bochinttoos. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Yiikon, eeppa aadhii mintsii maaqqide asi yi7i, eza wolqqidhi gamiko ammaninttii danccide danccito billizii, E qoltto bonqii melle asis shaakkane.<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>«Taara maaqqikaazay tana ixxane; taara shiishoosay lalane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mar. 9:40</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuna Ayyaana asappa kezii maaqqii gele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>«Tuna ayyaana asappa kezide wode shemppize bessi koyi hyaatsi baayze bessara wutane. Shemppize bessi dhabide wode ‹Ta kezide besite maaqqada› yagaane. <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>E maaqqize wode keetsita fixinttii lo77i yezin denggida. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Yinnippa suuba, hyanggi eeppa aadhii iitide melle laappun tuna ayyaanuntsana ekkii ye7ine. E gidda gelii yessi aykkane. Ye atstses tiinostippa suubanna aadhii iita maaqqane» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Yesuusa yinna ohitilla afa yessadera fettii maachita as giddappa denddii, fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Nena tookkide sazitan ne dhanggide dhantsita anjjinttida» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Yezin E, «Anjjinttiduntsi Xoozze qaaltto si7i kiitinttizuntsana» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoonasa malla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Gaama asuntsi shiiqide wode Yesuusa, «Hyanna yeletuntsi iita; kille malla koyane. Yezin Yoonasa mallitip melle unttis ingginttoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:4">Maato. 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mar. 8:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Yoonasa Nenewe asuntsis malla maaqqide fana As Na7ayin hyanna yeletuntsis malla maaqqada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:4">Waha. 3:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Saaba kaatita firdda wode hyantsi yeletuntsara denddii firddoda. Akkos gayko, iza Solomona cinccatitsito si7odes sa7a gaxappa denddii yi7ida. Yikke Solomonappa aadhizay hyanne yene<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1 Kat. 10:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Zeena 9:1-12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Nenewe asuntsi firdda wode hyantsi yeletuntsara denddii unttalla afa firddoda. Akkos gayko Yoonasa sibkketer maarotitsi gelida. Yikke, Yoonasappa aadhize hyanne yene» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:5">Waha. 3:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Galla foo7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>«Xomppe xomppii aachichcha bessa woy ota gidda gaddize asi baaya. Asi foo7ito be7ade fana dhoqqa bessa gaddane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:15">Maato. 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mar. 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Luqa. 8:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Ne gallitis foo7o ne aafto. Ne aafta lo77o maaqqiko, ne kumutsi galtta foo7ane. Nena aafe hyarggiko ne galtta ubbanna dhumane. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Yinnii gisho, ne gidda yeze foo7ize dhumaame gaar naagintto. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Yikke, ne kuntsi galtta foo7o maaqqiko, ne galtten melle dhuma bessi dhabiko, ne gallita kumutsita foo7o fana maaqqane» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Izippun baduntsana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Maato. 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mar. 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Yesuusa fa ohito hyaaside fana fettii Farisaawuze faara katstsa ma7ade fana xeegida. E eera fettilla gelii muusalla bettida. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Farisaawuze Yesuusa katstsa ma7adeppa tiinii kushe meeccosanno bi7i gaama qoppida.<verse eid="LUK 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Laatstsii eego, «Yin Farisaawuntsi burccuqosin shaatesin katta zaltto meeccane. Yezin yin ganccita uuzatitsaran iitabazaran kumida. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Yin, eeyuntso, katta zaltto medhdhide ganccito medhdhiday eza baane? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Yezin burccuqon shaaten yezanno dahuntsis inggote. Ye wode yinttis ubba bazita geeshi maaqqada.<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>«Farisaawuntso yinttana bade, kartsi gaalappa, xalooteppa, yinnii fana yeze bazappa asraata kessane. Yezin xillotitsin Xooz kadhe yin gidda baaya. Melluntsana ashshikaayzara hyantsesana oochchodes beezane, yezin ashshida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Leewe 27:30</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>«Farisaawuntso yinttana bade, Ayhude woosa Keetstsite bonchcho oyda, gabe gidda bonchcho sarotse kadhane.<verse eid="LUK 11:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>«Bestta dhabin asuntsi erikaayzara kattara yedhdhize booza aazuntso yinttana bade» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Higge asttamaarize mahi, «Asttamaarizayo, ne yinno ga7ite nuna cazhane» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Yesuusa, «Yin, higge asttamaaruntso, yinttana bade, asuntsi tookkodes dandda7oose deexo toofo toossane, yezin yin yin omitis melle atto yezin gil7a bertstsaran bochchoos.<verse eid="LUK 11:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>«Yin aduntsi wodhide nabunts boozito yin giigize gisho yinttana bade. <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Yikke, yin aduntsi oochito mintsodes un wodhide nabunts boozito yin loytsize gisho un iita oochchitis yin markka. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Yinnii gisho, Xoozii fa cinccatitsite, ‹Nabuntsanan hawaaruntsana ta yinttis kiittoda, yezin yin bagguntsana wodhoda; melluntsana bay7oda› yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Yinnii gisho, hyanna yeletuntsi alame medhinttidannippa hyanno yellodes goggide nabunts ubbunts suutsitis oocinttoda. <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>Aabeelappa dentsii zharsho besttisin Xoozze Keetstsappa gidda goggide Zakkariyaasa suutsiti gisho hyanna yeletuntsi oocinttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Medho 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20-21">2 Zeena 24:20-21</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>«Higge asttamaaruntso, yinttana bade, eratitsi qulfe yin kushe aykkida, yezin yinttisin geloos melluntsanan geltsoos» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Yesuusa yeygappa qitodes kezze wode higge asttamaaruntsin Farisaawuntsi eera ixxintti oocera waytsane. <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>E doonttippa keze qaaltte eza aykkodes koyi yinno oochchida.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Ayyaana mintsitsen naaginttize</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Maato. 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Ye wode gaama mukular faydinttize asuntsi wolal afa yedhdhinttode wontsis asi asalla afa shiiqii yessadera, Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsago, «Farisaawunts irshitippa naaginttote. Yinnan un cubbotitsito.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:6">Maato. 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:15">Mar. 8:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Qonccikaayzar aachintti, erinttoose genggii attizebaz akkon baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mar. 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Luqa. 8:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Yikke, yin dhuma ohidebaz ubba foo7o sinttoda, qol7a gidda kalkashide baz qoncce bessa ohinttoda.<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>«Ta bagguntso, ta ohizanno si7ote; asho wodhane fattin melle akkon oochchodes dandda7osuntsana zhashtippete. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Yiikon, yin zhashitodes beeziza ta yinttis qonccissada. Yinnan wodhidannippa suuba Gaanname olodes wolqqa yezes ees zhashtote. Yee, turo gaane; ees zhashtote. <verse eid="LUK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>Ichchin buubbuntsi fettii santimes bayzinttoossane? Yi7op attin unttappa feten Xoozze tiintte botinttoos. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Melle atto yezin, yin omma isintsitan faydinttii yene. Yikke, zhashtippete; gaama buubbuntsappa yin aadhane.<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>«Ta ohizanno si7ote; as tiino taas markkidhize ubbuntsis As Na7ay Xoozze kiitanchchuntsi tiintte markkidhoda. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>As tiino tana kaaddizes Xoozze kiitanchchuntsi tiintte ta eza kaaddoda. <verse eid="LUK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>As Na7alla afa leqqo qaala ohize ubbuntsi maarotitsi demmada, yezin Geeshi Ayyaanalla afa leqqo qaala ohizes maarinttoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:32">Maato. 12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:29">Mar. 3:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>«Asi yinttana aykkii Ayhude woosa Keetstsa, daynnuntsi tiintten kaatuntsi tiintte gochichize wode akko ohodyezakon waagii mahod yezako yirggippete.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">Maato. 10:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:11">Mar. 13:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:14-15">Luqa. 21:14-15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Ye wode yin ohodebaz Geeshi Ayyaana yinttana tamaarssoda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dure atstse eeyatitsito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>As giddappa fettii asi Yesuusago yi7i, «Ta ishe taas nu aday laatappa shagode fana ees oho» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Naate atstsayo, yinttalla afa tana daynnan laata shaakkize cima mahide oode?» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Mahika Yesuusa, «Asi yessi qolo gaamatitsara maaqqoosse gisho iira ashshii mintsii yinttana naaginttote» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Kaallii aazizera, «Gade gaama katstsa inggize fettii dure atstse yene. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Ye atstse, ‹Ta katsito ta shiishodes bessi eeride gisho akko oochcho?› yaga7i fa wozintte qoppida. <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Yikkeppa yeyssada; tiino yeze fachito lalii melle dalggii facha keexxoda. Katsiton taas yeze baz mulo ize shiishoda. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Fa shemppitigo, ‹Ta shemppite, gaama beres nees maaqqade qolo shiishida. Yikke, shemppii mo7o, uzho, ufaytto› yaga7oda.<verse eid="LUK 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>«Yezin Xoozii, ‹Naate, eeya hyay atstsayo, hyayno qamma ne shemppita neeppa ekkinttane. Yikke, ne shiishide bazita oodes maaqqade?› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>«Yinnii gisho, faas duretitsi sa7a shiishize asis, Xoozze kale dure maaqqoosse asis foltta hyay atstsestii fana» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Un7inttippete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Maato. 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsago, «Yikke, ta ohizanno si7ote, yin shemppitis akko mo7o yin galttis akko ma77o yaga7i un7inttippete. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Shemppo katstsappa galla afulappa aadhane. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Landduntsana bo7ote budoos, maxoos, elen fachan baaya. Yezin Xoozii unttana muuzane. Yin landduntsappa gaama aadhane. <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Yeezin, yinttappa un7intti fa berttilla afa fettii qamma gujjodes dandda7ize oode? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Yikke, hyanna eeratsi bazito oochchodes dandda7oose yin mellebazis akkos un7intte? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>Ane fudhe wayzi diccizako bo7ote. Waayoos suqqoos. Melle atto yezin, Solomonan fa yeze bonchchite ubbanne unttappa fete gaarzan ma77ikaaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1 Kat. 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2 Zeena 9:3-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Yin, ammano faccezuntso, yikke, Xoozii hyayno benttii wontta tama olinttode fudhito hyannigaara ma7isiko, yinttana wayzi aatsii ma7isoso? <verse eid="LUK 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>Yinnii gisho, akko mo7o woy akko uzho ga7i un wozintto izilla afa mahippe. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Yinno ubba Xooz ammanoosse asuntsi fa wozintto izilla mahane. Yezin yin aday Xoozay yinna ubbanna yinttis koshshizanno erane. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Ubbannippa aatsii Xoozze ka7itumo koyote yinna ubbanna yinttis gujjii ingginttoda.<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>«Yin, eeratsi worzhuntso, zhashtippete; yin aday Xoozze ka7itumtto yinttis immades ufayttane. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Yinttis yeze baz bayzi dahuntsis inggote. Kayzo ekkosanne, bila mo7osanne, cinggoosse karxite, hyal7oose qoltto salo shiishote. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Yin wozintta yin qoltta yeze besite maaqqada.<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Barkki naage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>«Danccinttii giiginttote; yin xomppita foo7izanno maaqqe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:1-13">Maato. 25:1-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>Fa laatstse zhaganappa maaqqade wontsis barkki naagizuntsi fana, laatstsii yi7i xeegize wode ellisii bugodes giigide asunts fana yi7ote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:34-36">Mar. 13:34-36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Fa laatstse maaqqize wode genttikaayzara naagizuntsi anjjinttiduntsana. Turo gaane; laatstsii danccii leemate kale betitsii mokkane. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Laatstsii giddii bilahe maaqqin woy wontti maatse maaqqin yi7i, yinnii fana genttikaayzara naagizin denggide yentsi aruntsi anjjinttiduntsana. <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>Yezin hyanno erote; kayzo ayde ye7odyezako karttii aday erizako keetsita bookkinttize wode si77i ga7i bo7oos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39-40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:23-44">Maato. 24:23-44</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Yinttin giigii naagote; As Na7ay yin qoppikaayze wode ye7oda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Phexiroosan, «Laatstso hyanna aazizto nu xalaalas ohinene woy as ubbuntsis?» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Laatstsii mahi, «Yikke, katstsa muussades beezze wodite inggode fana laatstse fa aruntsalla afa shuumide ammantsizayin wozinaama hyalaqize oode? <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Laatstsii maaqqize wode yinnii fana oochitera benttize arize E anjjinttidaya <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Ta yinttis turo ohine; fa laatstses yeze qolo ubbannilla afa E shuuminttoda. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Yezin ye arize, ‹Ta laatstsay elle ye7oos› yaga7i fa wozintte qoppii, maachi aruntsanan dhiiratsi aruntsana hyadhdhiko, mahi faas koyde fana mu7iteran uzhitera matstsiko, <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>ye arize laatstse E qoppikaayze qamman yirggoosse wode ye7oda. Yi7i eza gachchii, E iddilto ammanoose asuntsara mahoda.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>«Laatstse qofa gaara giigosen E laatstse akko kadhizako eriite oochchoose arize gaama garafinttoda. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Yezin fa laatstse qoftto eranxii attii garafinttodes beezanno oochcheze eeratsi garafinttoda. Akkos gayko gaama ingginttideppa gaama koynttane, gaama hyadara ekkiduntsappa gaama inggoda ga7i naaginttane.<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sarotitsis maaqqikaayzin shaakkinttes</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Maato. 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>«Taanii yi7idanna sa7alla afa tama aytsodes. Hyatte tama aykkizako tana wayzi ufayssod yeshsha! <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Maaqqo yezin, ta hyatte xammaqinttode xinqqate yene. E folinttode wontsis ta shemppita shemppoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:38">Mar. 10:38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Sa7alla afa sarotitsi ko7odes yi7ida yinttis aazane? Baaya, ta yi7idanna shagodes. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Hyatteppa aykkii woli gidda shaakkinttide ichchin keetsi asuntsi fettilla yene. Lam77untsi hyaydzuntsalla afa, hyaydzuntsin lam77untsalla afa, denddii shaakkinttane. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Aday na7illa afa, na7in adella afa, intta naatilla afa, naata inttilla afa, azinze intta naaze machchitilla afa, na7ay machchita azinze inttilla afa, denddii shaakkinttoda.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mik. 7:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wodito ero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Maato. 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Manin asuntsago, «Awa gelo zalara salo dhonidhize wode bi7i, ellisii, ‹Ira ye7oda› yagaane, gayde fana hyanane. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Yeekka zala baqo baqqize wode ‹Saata awoda› yagaane, gayde fana hyanane» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Yin, cubbuntso, Salobazin sa7abaz shaakkii erane yezin hyanna wodito shaakkii ere yinttana wayzi gamido?<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>«Yeezin, yin omitis akkos turtto erii firddoso? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Ne morkkizera wolla daynna tiino eqqodes hyanggitera ogella afa giigodes koyo. Ne giiganxi ixxiko goshichchii daynna tiino nena kanggoda. Daynnize nena poolises aatsii inggoda. E nena woyne oloda. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Si7ote, fettii bakkana ashshikaayzara ciggii hyaasode wontsis ne izippa kezaamanno ero» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Nagarappa maaqqe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Ye wode Yesuusago asuntsi yi7i Philaaxoosa wodhii un suutsitira un zharshito worqqide Galila asuntsbaz ohide asuntsi yinna besite yene. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>E hyannigaara yaga7i mahida; «Yeezin yentsi Galila asuntsi yinna iita hyayqito hyayqqide gisho Galila yeze asi ubbannippa aadhide nagaranchcho aazane? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Baaya! Maaqqo yezin, yinttin maarotitsar maaqqaanxi ixxiko, ubbanna yinnii gaara dhaboda. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Woy mahi Salihoome gaaze besite gimbbe woddii wodhide taphpho osfun asuntsi Yerusalaame yeze as ubbannippa aadhize nagaranchcho aazane? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Baaya! Yezin yinttin maarotitsar maaqqaanxi ixxiko ubbanna yinnii gaara dhaboda.»<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aafe aafoosse belese minxa aazize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Mahin Yesuusa hyannigaara ga7i aazize ohida: «Fettii atstses woyne gade tukinttide belese minxa yene. E iippa aafe koyi yi7i akkon denggikaaya. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Gaditii aday woyne oochchizego, ‹Aafe denggodes koyi hyaydzdzii bere yi7i bi7in akkon denggikaaya. Yinnii gisho, gachchii hyaaso; akkos sa7ito melize?› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>«Yezin oochchizay, ‹Laatstso, I kantto oochchii ozha olode wontsis hyay berizes ashshoya. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Wontsi bere aafiko lo77o, ixxiko gachchii ashsho› » yaga7i mahida.<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bantte kuunide maachita faxida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Yesuusa Sambbata qamma Ayhude woosa Keetstsa tamaarssane. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Yinna besite taphpho osfun bere tuna ayyaana bantto kuunizide fettii maachita yene. Iza kuunnidanippa denddii luule eqqodes dandda7oos. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Yesuusa izo bi7ide wode xeegii, «Hyanna maachite, ne hyarggitippa faxida» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Fa kushito iilla afa gaddin, iza iira luule eqqida. Xooz mana galatida.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Yezin Ayhude woosa Keetstsa hyalaqize zhilidhdhii astigo, «Oocha oochchize izippun qammita yene. Yinnii gisho, yinna qammite yi7i faxote fattin Sambbata qamma koshoos» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:9-10">Keze 20:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13-14">Mahe 5:13-14</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Laatstsii, «Cubbuntso, yin giddappa bora woy hyaarii Sambbata qamma zadaloppa billii hyaatsi ushshodes kanggoosse oode? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Yeezin, hyanna maachita Abrahama na7a maaqqitera xalahera acinttii taphpho osfun bere kumutsi yezidannis Sambbata qamma bilinttodes beezosaane?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="LUK 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>E yinno ohide wode ixxizuntsi ubba yeellidhida. Yezin asuntsi ubba E oochchide gaama qofize oocha ubbanne ufayttida.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Eeratsi minxa aafen irisho aazize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa hyannigaara yagayda, «Xoozze ka7itumtta akko aaze? Izo akkora aazisade? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Xoozze ka7itumo fettii asi fa gadite tukkide wala aafe fana. E diccii minxa maaqqida. Landda E koshtilla afa shemppida.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Mahi, «Xoozze ka7itumtto akkora aazisade? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Fettii maachita gaama dhiillara worqqii munuqide eerats irshsho aazane» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xuuntsi furtsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa Yerusalaame qititera E aadhize ogite yeze katamiten kara gancce tamaarssite aadhida. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Fettii asi Yesuusago, «Laatstso, attoduntsi eeratsi as xalaalane?» ga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yesuusa unttago, <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>«Si7ote, xuuntsi furtsara gelodes minggote. Gaamuntsi gelodes koyane yezin unttis hyanoos. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Kartti aday denddii furtsito gorddidannippa suuba ‹Nuus bugoya› ga7i bale eqqii xeege aykkoda. Yezin E, ‹Yin oona yezakon abappa ye7ezakon ta eroos› ga7i mahoda. <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Ye wode yin, ‹Neera wolla mu7ida, uzhida, nu bucalla tamaarssida› yagawuda.<verse eid="LUK 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>«E mahi, ‹Yin oona yezakon abappa ye7ezakon eroos. Yin, wobbuntso taappa hyaakkote› yagawuda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Maz. 6:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>Abrahama, Yisaaqa, Yayqooban nabunts ubbunts Xoozze ka7itumtte bo7oda, yezin yin bale wodhdhii attize wode yinttis yeefon achchi garcingge maaqqada. <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Asuntsi awa kessappa, awa geloppa, wookka zalappan yeekka zalappa yi7i Xoozze ka7itumtte muusalla afa bettoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:11-12">Maato. 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:13">22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Yinnii gisho, hyatte yestte suub maaqqiduntsappa tiino maaqqaduntsi, tiino maaqqiduntsappa suub maaqqaduntsi yene» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Maato. 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:16">20:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mar. 10:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Yerusalaames yeekkida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Maato. 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Ye wode Farisaawutsappa fete fete yi7i, «Heroodisa nena wodhodes koyze gisho hyanna bestippa denddii qito» gayda.<verse eid="LUK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>E mahi, «Hyanggi, ye workkanzes yikke, ‹Hyaynon wontta tuna ayyaanuntsana kessoda, hyargginttizuntsana fatstsoda, hyaydzintsa qamma fololla afa yelloda› yagayda ga7ote. <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Yi7op attin, nabe Yerusalaameppa melle bessa hyayqqodes beezoos. Yinnii gisho, hyaynon, wonttan yintton feezhii yinna bestto qitodes denddida.<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>«Yerusalaame, Yerusalaame, nabuntsana wodhizanne, neego kiitinttiduntsana shuchchara wodhizanne, lukule fa na7untsana fa qefiti gancce shiishizanifana ne na7untsana ta kushtippa oomora wantsi tohe shiishodes koydo, yezin yin koyoos gayda. <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Ta yinttis ohine; yin keetsita kayzoda. Laatstse suntsite ye7ize anjjinttidaya yin gawude wontsis tana denggoos» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Maz. 118:26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:5">Er. 22:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa sambbata qamma fettii hyargginttiza fatstsida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Fettii Sambbata qamma Yesuusa fettii Farisaawunts hyalaqize kara katstsa ma7ades gelize wode asuntsi dakkii be7ine. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Yinna besite shafe wodatsi hyargginttize fettii asi ees tiino zalara woy7ida. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Yesuusa Farisaawuntsagon higge asttamaaruntsago «Sambbata qamma hyargginttiza fatstsizanna wogaane woga baa?» yaga7i oocida. <verse eid="LUK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Un si77i gayda. Yesuusa hyargginttize atstsa bochchii fatstsi moyzida.<verse eid="LUK 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Mahin yinttappa fetes na7a woy bora Sambbata qamma gaga qitiko ellisii kessoose oode?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:11">Maato. 12:11</ref></char></note>yaga7i oocida. <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Un fettibazin mahodes dandda7ikaaya.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dalggatitsin zaqqo mokken</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Yesuusa sarges xeeginttiduntsi bonchcho bessi doorizanno bi7i, hyanna aazizto ohida: <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>«Fettii asi nena sarge xeegiko bonchcho bessa bettipe. Neeppa aadhii bonchchinttize asi xeeginttodes dandda7ane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:6-7">Aazi. 25:6-7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>Yinttana lam77untsana xeegide yi7i, ‹Ne bestto hyay zaqqizes dakko› yagaaze wode ne yeellidhittera ziqqa bessa wodhdhoda. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Yezin, ne xeeginttide wode tiinidhii ziqqa bessa bi7i betto. Xeegize yi7i, ‹Ta laggizayo, hyanna bonchcho besite betto› yaga7oda. Ye wode neera fettilla xeeginttide as ubbunts tiintte ne bonchchinttoda. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Fana dhoqi dhoqi yiize ubbanna yeellidhada; fana ziqqii ziqqii yiize ubbanna dhoqi dhoqi ga7oda.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Maato. 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">Luqa. 18:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Mahi Yesuusa eza mokkide keetstsiti adego, «Quma woy kawo sarge xeegize wode neenii kushe mahiza xeegaame fana ne lagguntsana woy ne ishuntsana woy ne iginutsana woy ne dure dootsuntsana sarge xeegippe. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Yezin, ne sarge giigizeze wode dahuntsana, wobbuntsana, gunddiduntsana qooquntsana xeego; ne anjjinttoda. <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>Hyantses kushe mahodes dandda7oose gisho kushe mahita geeshshuntsi denddize qamma nees maaqqada» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Damma diggisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Maato. 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Yesuusara wolla diggisalla afa bettizunts giddappa fete yinno si7i, «Xoozze ka7itumtte diggisalla afa bettide anjjinttidaya» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Yesuusa, «Fettii asi damma diggisa giigizii gaama asuntsana xeegida. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Diggisa mokunttize saata yellide wode xeeginttide zaquntsana, ‹Yikke ubba bazita giigida, hyayga yo7ote› yaga7i xeegode gaar fa ariza kiittida.<verse eid="LUK 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>«Yezin ubbuntsi faas madha madha medhdhida. Fete, ‹Hyatte hyaga gade wonggide gisho hyanggi be7ades beezane aade tana ashshoya yaga7o› yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Hyankkay, ‹Ichchin waaxa bora wonggida unttana waaxi be7ade gisho aade tana lanccipe› yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Mahi hyankkay, ‹Taanii hyaga medda yeze gisho ye7odes dandda7oos› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>«Arize maaqqii yi7i yinna ubbanno fa laatstses ohida. Ye wode diggisa aday zhilidhdhi arizego, ‹Ellisii katama yeze dalgga ogen oge gaxa hyanggi, dahuntsana, wobbuntsana, qooquntsanan gundduntsana hyankka ko7o› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>«Arize, ‹Ta laatstsayo, ne kiittide ubbanna folinttida, yezin hyatten bessi yene› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>«Laatstsii arizego, ‹Oge woralla afan, katamappa gaxa kessize oge kezo, ta keetsita kumode wontsis denggide ubbuntsi ye7ode fana oochcho. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Ta yinttis ohine; xeegintti ixxiduntsappa ooden ta diggisttippa mo7osanno erote› gayda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Laatstsi kaallizanna zharshizane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Gaama asuntsi eera wolla hyammadera Yesuusa unttago suub maaqqii, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>«Taago yi7ide ubbuntsi fa adayan fa intton, fa machchiton fa na7untsana, fa ishuntsana fa mishuntsana, melle atto yezin fa de7ito ixxoose ta tamaare maaqqades dandda7oos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:37">Maato. 10:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Fa masqaltto tookkii tana kaalloose ta tamaare maaqqades dandda7oos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:13">Maato. 10:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24">16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mar. 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Luqa. 9:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>«Yinttappa fettii asi shuchchi keetstsi keexxodes koyko, keetsito keexii hyaasodes akko gaar miishe koshshizako tiinidhii erodes qoppii bo7oose oode? <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Yinno maaqqanxiko, ye atstse baasa yiitsi shuchchito yiixxin fole gamiko, <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>be7ize ubbanna, ‹Hyay atstse keetsi aykkin folodes eza gamida› yaga7i leqqane.<verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>«Woy fettii kaati melle kaatara olinttodes dendditera lam7itam mukul wottadaruntsana ekkii ye7ize kaatizera taphphi mukul wottadaruntsara olintti dandda7odannon dandda7oosanno bettii zorinttoosse oode? <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Olinttodes dandda7inttoosebaz maaqqiko, ye ye7ize kaatizera hyaakora yezin giigodes tiinidhii cima dakkii oocane. <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Yinnii gaara, yinttappa ooden faas yeze baz mulo ashshanxii ixxiko ta tamaare maaqqades dandda7oos.<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>«Sooge lo77o, yezin sooge fa mal77ito ashshiko, wayzi sooge ga7inttodes dandda7e? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Gade araddizesin maaddoose baz maaqqize gisho alla olinttane. Yikke, si7ize hyaye yeze asi si7o» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Dhabide duro aazize</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Maato. 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Fettii wode qaraxe gachchizuntsin nagaranchchuntsi Yesuusa timirttito si7odes E kale shiiqida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:29-30">Luqa. 5:29-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Yezin Farisaawuntsin higge asttamaaruntsi, «Hyay atstse nagaranchchuntsana shiishii ekkane, unttara fettilla muune» yaga7i zuuzinggida.<verse eid="LUK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Yesuusa yaga7i hyanna aazizto unttis ohida: <verse eid="LUK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>«Yin giddappa fetes xeet duruntsi yeze baz maaqqiko unttappa fetay dhabiko uddufun tam uddufununtsana yenggize bessa ashshii dhabidaya demmade wontsis koyoose oode? <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Denggide wode ufaytti fa gannite tookkii, <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>fa kara maaqqane. Fa lagguntsanan dootsuntsana fettilla xeegii, ‹Dhabide ta duriza denggida, taara wolla ufayttote› yagaane. <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Yinnii gaara, maarotitsi koshshoosse uddufun tam uddufun xilluntsappa aatsii maarotitsi gelize fettii nagaranchchize gisho salo damma ufayssi maaqqane.<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>«Woy taphphi shuchchi bira yeze fettii maachita taphphitippa fettii shuchchi birize dhabiko denggode wontsis xomppe aytsii keetstsi fixxii mintsii koyosanna oode? <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Denggide wode fa lagguntsanan fa dootsuntsana xeegii ‹Dhabide ta fettii birza denggide gisho taara ufayttote› yagaane. <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Si7ote, yinnii fana fettii maarotitsi gelize nagaranchchize gisho Xoozze kiitanchchuntsi tiino ufayssi maaqqane» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dhabi benttide na7a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Mahi Yesuusa, «Fettii atstses lam77i na7untsi yene. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Unttappa geez na7ay fa adego, ‹Ta adayo, ne qolttippa ta gishtto taas inggo› yagayda. Aday fa qoltto fa na7untsis gizhida. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Eerats qammappa suuba geez na7ay fa gishtto mulo accii ekkii hyaako sa7a qitida. Yeyga kaasara qoltto lalii hyaasida. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>E faas yezebazito mulo hyaasidannippa suuba yinna sa7ite ubbanne mintsii naye kezin madhidhida. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Yinnii gisho, yinna sa7ite asuntsappa fete kara yessades gelida. Atstsay eza gudayille yemmade gaar yenggize bessa dakkida. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Gudayluntsi muuze hyarqqoppa ma7ades amudhdhida, yezin izon ees inggize asi benttikaaya. <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>Wozina maaqqin, ‹Wantsi ta aday aruntsis katstsa alla attin ta hyanne nayera hyayqqodes yellido?› <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Denddii ta adego hyanggi, ‹Ta adayo, Xoozin, nenan qohida. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Yikkeppa ne na7a ga7intti xeeginttodes taas beezoosse gisho ne kara yeze aruntsappa fetay fana tana faydo› yaga7oda» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Yinnii gisho, denddii fa adego qitida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">«Yiikon, E hyaga hyaakora yezin aday yiqsinttii, eego woxxii hyanggi iringgi yeerida. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Naazen, ‹Ta adayo Xoozin, nenan ta qohida. Yikkeppa ne na7a ga7intti xeeginttodes beezosi› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>«E aday aruntsana xeegii, ‹Ellisii ubbuntsappa lo77o maaqqide ma7o ki7i eza mayzote; E gil7ite migiddo, E tohite caamma aatstsote. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Modhdho wofaano ki7i shukkote, ma7ada, ufayttoda. <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Ta na7ay hyayni hyayqqida, yezin hyatte faxida; dhabida, yezin benttida› yagayda. Yinnippa suuba, ufaytte aykkida.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>«Ye wode anggis na7ay oocha gade yene. Yeygappa yi7itera kara ukkodera yetstsin doolle ootsi si7ida. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>E, aruntsappa feta xeegii hyanide bazita akko yezakon erodes oocida. <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Arizen, ‹Ne ishe saro yi7ide gisho ne aday modhdho wofaano ees shukkida› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>«Anggis ishe zhilidhdhi keetstsa gelodesin koyikaaya. Aday bale kezii keetstsa gelode fana eza woossida. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Yezin E fa adego, ‹Yikke, hyannii gaar bere ta nees aridhdhii ne kiittippa fetton faccizikaayzara nees kiitinttin ta ta lagguntsara ufayttode fana melle atto yezin fettii gashe deeshi inggikaaya. <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Yezin, hyayni ne na7ay ne qoltto olaluntsara lalii yi7in modhdho wofaano shukkida› » yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>«Aden, ‹Ta na7ayo, neenii ubba wode taara yene, ta baz ubbanna nees. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Hyayni ne ishe hyayqqida, yezin faxida; dhabida, yezin benttida. Yinnii gisho, gaama ufayttodes beezane› ga7oda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Ammaninttoose shuuma aazize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsago, «Fettii dure atstses eeppa yeekkara fettii shuuma yene. Ye shuumize fa laatstse qoltto lalane yagaaze wore karttii adaya yellida. <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>Karttii aday shuumiza xeegizi, ‹Ta wagizebaz si7ido? Yikkeppa neenii ta keetstsitis shuuma maaqqii oochchodes dandda7oosse gisho ta qoltto tana yeltso› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>«Ye shuumizen fa wozintte hyannigaara yaga7i qoppida. ‹Ta laatstsay tana shuumatitsitippa hyaasodes yi7ine, wooti aqodes wolqqa baaya, woossii ma7ades yeellizane; yeezin ta waya? <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Shuumatitsitippa ta wodhdhize wode asuntsi tana mokkode fana oochchode baz ta erane› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>«Yinnii gisho, E laatstse gale yeze asuntsana feta feta xeegii ki7i tiino atstsego, ‹Neella afa ta laatstse gale wantsi yeze?› yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="LUK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>«E, ‹Lam7itam barmeele zayte gale yene› yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:6">«Shuumize, ‹Wule warqate hyatte, ellisii, taphphi barmeele zayte gale yene ga7i xaafo› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>«Yinnippa kaallii lam7antsizego, ‹Nees wantsi yeze?› yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">«E, ‹370 kunttaale zarga gale yene› yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">«Shuumize, ‹Ne wule warqate hyatte, ellisii, 296 kunttaale yaga7i xaafo› yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>Karttii aday ammaninttikaayze shuumiza E cinccatitsitis nashshida. Hyanna alamtti na7untsi as ayfora foo7o na7untsappa aadhide wozinaama.<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>«Yinnii gisho, ta yinttis ohine; hyanna alamtti bira hyal7ize wode medhina keetstsite mokkinttode fana hyanna miishitira yinttis lagge wonggote. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Ubbappa eerats baza ammaninttide gaama baza ammaninttidaya maaqqane. Mahi ubbappa eerats baza ammaninttoose gaama baza ammaninttoos. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Yikke, hyanna alamtti birara yin ammaninttanxii ixxiko turii bira yinttis oode hyadara immade? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Yin melle as birtte ammaninttanxiko, yin buzo bira yinttis oode immade?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>«Fettii arize lam77i laatstsuntsis aqodes dandda7oos. Feta ixxiko hyankkaya kadhane woy fetego shiiqiko hyankkaya leqqane. Yinnii gaara, yin Xoozisin birasin aqodes dandda7oos.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 6:24">Maato. 6:24</ref> </char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Bira kadhize Farisaawuntsi yinno si7i Yesuusa leqqida. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>E, «Yin yinttana as tiino beezane, yezin Xoozii yin wozintto erane. As tiino bonchchinttiday Xoozze tiino borunttidaya.<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>«Muse higgitan nabunts kiita Wahannisa yellodes yinttis oochitera gam7ida. Yinnippa suuba, Xoozze ka7itumo Wonggeltta sabbakinttite gam7ida. Asi ubba yeyga gelodes dafinttane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Maato. 11:12-13</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Yezin, higgitippa fettii yishsha fidaale attodannippa salon sa7an aadhizanna laafane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5:18">Maato. 5:18</ref> </char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>«Fa machchito dakkii melle ekkize ubba olalane. Fa azinzeppa anjjinttidanno ekkizayin olalane» gayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Maato. 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1 Qoro. 7:10-11</ref> </char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dure atstsan Alaazaren</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>«Al7on lo77o bonchcho afula ma7ize, sa7a giigin ubba wode ufayssara yeze fettii dure asi yene. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Melle mahi galtta kumutsi hyargitsi maaqqide fettii Alaazare ga7inttize dahize ye dure atstse bale olintti attiday yene. <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>Nayeppa denddii dure atstse leematippa wodhdhize gufa ma7ades amudhdhii yene. Melle atto yezin, kanuntsi yi7i E hyarggits besito laa7ane.<verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>«Ye dahize hyayqqida; kiitanchchuntsi eza Abrahama shuphite ekkida. Mahi dure atstsen hyayqqii mooginttida. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Si7oole un7intti yezitera dhoqi ga7i hyaakora Abrahaman E shuphite yeza Alaazare bi7ida. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>E, ‹Aabbo Abrahama, taas yiqsinttoya; hyanna loxize tamtte un7intti yeze gisho Alaazare fa gil7iza hyaatsa dakkii ta il7antsito laakitsode fana aade eza dakkoya› yaga7i uukkida.<verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>«Yezin Abrahama eego, ‹Ta na7ayo, ne sa7a yeze wode lo77o bazito ekkidanno, mahi Alaazare iita baz ekkidanno qoppo. Yezin hyatte E hyanne ufayttane, mahi ne waayintti yene› yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Hyanna ubbannippa aadhii, ‹Hyaygappa yinttago, sekkappa hyankka nuugo aadhodes koyzuntsi finggaame fana nuusin yinttis gidda damma gaga yene› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>«Dure atstse, ‹Ta adayo, yeezako Alaazare ta aday kara kiittode fana ta nena woossane. <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>Taas ichchin ishuntsi yene, unttin hyanna madha besite ye7aame fana unttis wodhdhii markkidho› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>«Yezin Abrahama, ‹Unttis Musen nabuntsin yene; un ohizanno si7o› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 16:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>«Dure atstse, ‹Aabbo Abrahama, yinnii fana baaya; fettii asi hyayqoppa denddii wodhdhiko un maarotitsi geloda› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>«Abrahama, ‹Musen nabuntsna si7anxiko, melle atto yezin hyayqoppa fettii asi denddii ohikon ammanoos› yagayda.»<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Kiitinttize adetitsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsago, «As dhubutsi nagara geltsizebaz yi7ikaayzara attaama. Maaqqikon, nagara gidda gelode fana oochchize atstsa bade» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Ye atstse eeratsuntsappa feta balitsodannippa woxa fa afurtte accii abba geliko ees lo77o. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Yinnii gisho naaginttote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:15">Maato. 18:15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">«Ne ishe nagara oochchiko kacco; azzanii maarotitsar maaqqiko, ees atto yaga7o. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Fettii qammite laappun tohe qohii, laappun tohe, ‹Taanii ta isidanno erida tana maaro› yaga7i neego yiiko ees atto ga7o.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Hawaaruntsi Laatstsago, «Ammano nuus gujjoya» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Laatstsii, «Gaashe aafe fana ammano yinttis yeziko ‹Hyay waliza shodintti abba gidda tukintto› yagayko yinttis kiitinttoda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>Gujjii Yesuusa, «Yin giddappa fetes oochchize woy duro yenggize aro yeziko oocha gadeppa woy wudeppa kara yi7ide wode ‹Elle hyayga yi7i katstsa ma7ades betto› gaaze yene? <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Baaya, ‹Taas kawo giigizo; ta mu7i, uzhii ashshode wontsis eqqii muuzo. Yinnippa suuba, ne mu7i ushshada› yaga7osaane? <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Yikke, laatstse, arize kiitto folide gisho anjjanene? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Yinnii gisho, yinttin kiitinttidanno mulo folide wode ‹Nu fatsoosse aruntsana; oochchodes beezze oochito folida› ga7ote» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Qursuma hyarggeppa geezhide taphphi asuntsana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Yesuusa Yerusalaame hyanggitera Samaarasin Galila sa7asin giddara kantsii aadhida. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Fettii kara gancce gelize wode qursuma hyarggera aykkinttide taphphi asuntsi eza denggida. Unttin hyaakora eqqii, <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>«Laatstsi Yesuusa, nuus yiqsinttoya» yaga7i uukkida.<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>E unttana bi7ide wode «Hyanggi yin galtto Ayhude kahinuntsis beezote» yagayda. Un ogella hyanggitera geezhida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Leewe 14:1-32</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Unttappa fetay fa geezhidanno be7eze wode dhoqi gayde qaalara Xooz bonchchitera Yesuusago maaqqida. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>E Samaara sa7a asi, yezin Yesuusa tohitilla afa gol7i eza galatida.<verse eid="LUK 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Yesuusa, «Geezhiduntsi taphphi asi maaqqosane? Yeezin, uddufununtsi aba qitido? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Hyay allaga atstseppa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Hyay allaga atstseppa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Qursuma hyarggitippa faxide atstse allaga ga7inttidanna E Ayhude maaqqoosse gishos. </char></note> attin melle maaqqii Xooz galatide baaya ga7ene?» yaga7i oocida. <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Atstsego, «Ne ammantta nena geeshida; denddii qito» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoozze ka7itumo ye7ito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Maato. 24:23-28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Farisaawuntsi, «Xoozze ka7itumo ayde ye7ode?» ga7i Yesuusa oocida. E, «Xoozze ka7itumtta benttize mallara ye7oos. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Mahin izo, ‹Hyanne woy sekka yaga7odes dandda7oos. Akkos gayko, Xoozze ka7itumtta yin gidda yene› » yaga7i mahida.<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsago, «As Na7a qammitippa feta bo7odes yin amudhdhode wode ye7oda, yezin yin be7aama. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Asuntsi, ‹E yeyga yene› woy, ‹Hyanne yene› yaga7oda, yezin unttana kaallii qitippete. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Zeelintsi zeelinggii salo gaxappa gaxa foo7ize fana As Na7a ye7iti qammita yinnii fana yi7ada. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Yezin yinna hyanodannippa tiino As Na7ay gaama madhidhadesin hyanna yelette ixinttodes beezane. <verse eid="LUK 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>Nohe wode yi7ide fana As Na7ay woditen yinnii fana yi7ada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Medho 6:5-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Nohe Markkabe gelide qammito yellodes asuntsi mu7iteran uzhitera, ekkiteran gelitera yessadera dhabsse hyaatsita yi7i ubba dhabsida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:6-24">Medho 7:6-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>Looxe beren yinnii fana yi7ida. Asuntsi mu7iteran uzhitera, wonggiteran bayzitera, tukkiteran keexitera, gam7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:28-29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20-19:25">Medho 18:20—19:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Looxe Soodomeppa kezide qamma diinne ga7inttize michizebaz saloppa bukkii ubbuntsana dhabsida. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>As Na7ay qonccize woditen yinnii gaara yi7oda.<verse eid="LUK 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>«Ye wode ooden bale yeze keetstsa gidda yeze baz ekkodes keetstsa gelippe. Yinnii fana, gade yeze asi akko bazisin kara maaqqippe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:17-18">Maato. 24:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:15-16">Mar. 13:15-16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Looxe machchito tiirote;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Medho 19:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>fa shemppito ashshodes koyze asi ooden dhabssoda; fa shemppito aatsii inggize ooden E ashshoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Maato. 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mar. 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luqa. 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Waha. 12:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Ta yinttis ohine; ye wode lam77i asuntsi fettii datsalla woy7oda. Fete ekinttoda, hyankkay attoda. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Lam77i maachuntsi wolla gaaccodera fetta ekkinttoda, hyankkanna attoda. <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>[Lam77i asuntsi wolla gade oochchizuntsappa fetay ekinttoda, hyankkay attoda»]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fettii fettii maxaafite faydo 36 baaya. </char></note> yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Un, «Laatstso aba ekinttode?» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">E, «Gawuxa yeze bessa ankko shiiqane» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Miinggi woossode fana tamaarssida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsana azal7ikaayzar ubba wode woossode fana tamaarssodes koyi yaga7i aazize ohida: <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>«Fettii katama Xoozis zhashtoosse asin yeellidhoosse fettii daynna yene <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Yinna katamite fettii budantta yene. Izan, ‹Taasin ta morkkizes gidda yeze mootto firddo› yaga7i ubba wode ye daynnizego mahi mahi yi7ine. <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Daynnize eerats wodes I ohito si7anxi ixxida, yezin suubappa fa wozintte, ‹Taanii Xoozis zhashtoosa, asis yeellidhanxi ixxikon, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>hyanna budantta tana waayetsize gisho iisi firddoda; yeyzanxiko ubba wode yi7i tana labbisada› yaga7i qoppida» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Laatstsin, «Iita daynnize ga7idanno si7ida; <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Xoozii qamman awara eego uukkize fa dooriduntsis firddosaane? Unttana maaddodes gam7odaane? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Ta yinttis ohizanno si7ote, ellisii firddoda. Maaqqikon, As Na7ay ye7ize wode sa7alla afa ammano demmadyessane?» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Farisaawuzan qaraxe gachchizan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Mahi, Yesuusa, fana xillo asi fana mahi ceeqinttizuntsisin melluntsana leqqizuntsis hyannigaara yaga7i aazize ohida: <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>«Lam77i asuntsi woossodes Xoozze keetstsa hyanggida. Fete Farisaawe hyankkay mahi qaraxe gachchizize asi. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>Farisaawuze eqqii faas woossitera, ‹Xoozzayo taanii mellunts fana bonqize asi, iitan olale asi, aadhii mahi hyay qaraxe gachizize atstse fana maaqqikaayze gisho nena galatane. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Saaminttappa lam77i tohe xoomane, ta denggizebaz ubbannippa asiraata kessane› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>«Yezin qaraxe gachizize mahi hyaakora eqqii melle atto yezin Salo dhoqi ga7i be7adesin zhashtii fa dadabito qoxxittera ‹Xoozayo, tana nagaranchchiza maaroya› ga7i woossida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Maato. 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luqa. 14:11</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>Ta yinttis ohizanno si7ote; Farisaawizeppa hyayni qaraxe gachizize Xoozze tiintte xillo maaqqii fa kara maaqqida. Akkos gayko, fana dhoqi dhoqi yiize asi toochinttoda, fana toochize asi dhoqi dhoqi ga7oda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusan zhooga na7untsana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-30">Maato. 19:13-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-31">Mar. 10:13-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Yesuusa zhooga na7untsalla afa fa kushito gaddii anjjode fana asuntsi eego ke7ine. Yesuusa tamaaruntsi yinno bi7i akkos Yesuusago ke7e yaga7i kaccida. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Yezin Yesuusa na7untsana faago xeegii, «Na7untsi taago yo7odanno kayppete; yo7o ga7ote. Akkos gayko, Xoozze ka7itumo un fana yi7iduntsis. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Taanii yinttis turo ohine; Xoozze ka7itumo zhooga na7unts fana ekkoosse ooden yeyga geloos» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dure atstse ooce</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Maato. 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar. 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Ayhude hyalaquntsappa fete, «Keeha asttamaarzayo, medhina de7o denggodes akko oochcho?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Yesuusa eego, «Akkos tana keehizayo yaga7i xeege? Fettii Xoozzeppa attin melle keeha baaya. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>Olalippe, wodhippe, kaystippe, worddo markkidhippe, ne adayan ne intton bonchcho yagaaze kiitto erane» yaga7i oocida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Keze 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Mahe 5:16-20</ref> </char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Atstsayin, «Yentsesana ubba taanii na7atitsappa aykkii naagitera gam77ida» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Yesuusa yinno si7eze wode «Yikke, nees fettibaz faccane; nees yeze baz mulo bayzi dahuntsis inggo; salo nena qoltta naagane. Yeyzi maaqqii tana kaallo» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Yezin atstse yinno si7ide wode ees gaama qolo yeze gisho gaama zhilidhdhida.<verse eid="LUK 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Yesuusa atstsa bi7i, «Dure asis Xoozze ka7itumo gelizanna wayzi un7ode! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Dure Xoozze ka7itumo gelodannippa gimale marppe uruntsara aadhizanna laafane» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Yinno si7ide asuntsi, «Yeezako oode attode?» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Yesuusa, «Asis dandda7inttoose Xoozis dandda7inttane» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Phexiroosa, «Yikke nuunii nu baz mulo ashshii nena kaallane» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>«Yesuusa turo ta yinttis ohine; Xoozze ka7itumos ga7i fa keetsito woy fa machchito woy fa ishuntsana woy fa adayan fa intton woy fa na7untsana ashshide; <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>hyanna wodite gaama dakko, ye7ode alamite medhina de7o ekkoosse ooden baaya» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fa hyayqitibaz mahi ohida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Maato. 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar. 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Yesuusa taphpho lam77untsana faago xeegii, «Ane Yerusalaame yedhdhote, nabuntsi As Na7ay baz xaafidanna ubbanna yeyga folinttoda. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>E Ayhude maaqqoosse asis aadhii ingginttoda. Un eza leqqoda, cazhoda eella afa cuttoda. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Eza garafidannippa suuba wodhoda, yezin hyaydzintsa qamma E hyayqoppa denddoda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Yezin E tamaaruntsi yinna ubbannippa fettibazin tiirikaaya. E qoftta unttis aachinttide gisho E waaga7ezako erikaaya.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Qooqe atstse bi7ida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Maato. 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mar. 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Yesuusa Iyaarkko ukkize wode fettii qooqe atstse oge gaxa bettii woossane. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Qooqe atstse asuntsi yinna besttira aadhodera si7i, «Yinna akko?» ga7i oocida. <verse eid="LUK 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Un, «Naazirete Yesuusa hyannira aadhane» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>E, «Dawute na7ay, Yesuusa, tana maaroya» yaga7i uukkida.<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Tiino tiino hyanggize asuntsi, «Si7i ga7o» ga7i kaccida. Yezin E, «Dawute na7ayo, tana maaro» yaga7i gaantsi uukkida.<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Yesuusa eqqii atstsa faago ko7ode fana kiittida. Atstsayin, eego shiiqin, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>«Ta nees akko oochchode fana koye?» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Qooqize, «Laatstso ta bo7odes koyane» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Yesuusa, «bo7o, ne ammantta nena fatstsida» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 18:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Atstsay iira bi7i ashshida. Xooz bonchchitera Yesuusa kaallida. Asi ubbuntsi yinno bi7i Xooz galatida.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Qaraxe gachizize Zakkiyoosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Yesuusa Iyaarkko katama gelii aadhane. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Yeyga Zakkiyoosa ga7inttize qaraxe gachizuntsi hyalaqize yene. E gaama dure. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>E Yesuusa oode yezako be7ades koyda. E hyaata maaqqide gisho as gaamappa denddii Yesuusa be7ades dandda7ikaaya. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Yesuusa be7ades koyi E hyanggize ogitis tiino woxxii hyanggi fettii boobba minxalla afa kezida.<verse eid="LUK 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Yesuusa yinna besite yellittera dhoqi ga7i bi7i, «Zakkiyoosa, hyayno ta ne kara feeshades beeze gisho elle wodhdho» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>E ellisii wodhdhii ufayssara Yesuusa mokkida.<verse eid="LUK 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Yinna besite yeze asunts ubbanna yinno bi7i, «Nagaranchchize keetstsa gelii mokinttodes yi7ane» yaga7i zuuzinggida. <verse eid="LUK 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Maaqqo yezin, Zakkiyoosa eqqii Laatstsago, «Laatstso, yikke taas yeze qolo ubbannippa baggito dahuntsis inggoda. Asappa akko bazin worddora balitsii ekkidebaz maaqqiko oyddii kushe mahoda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Hyay atstse Abrahama kochchi maaqqide gisho hyayno atotitsi hyanna kartte yi7ida. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>As Na7ay yi7idanna dhabiduntsana koyodesin ashshodes» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:10">Maato. 18:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Taphphi minaanuntsi aazize</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Maato. 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Asuntsi yinno si7ize wode Yesuusa Yerusalaame ukkide gishon Xoozze ka7itumo hyatte ukkera qonccode fana yi7ize gisho unttis aazize ohida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11-27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Maato. 25:14-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Yinnii gisho, Yesuusa, «Fettii erinttide asi yeze faas kaatetitsi ekkii yo7odes melle sa7a qitida. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Ees oochchize aruntsappa taphphuntsana xeegii fetes fetes fettii minaane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Minaane: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Minaane Girike doona. Fettii minaane fettii oochcha asis ingginttize hyaydzdzii agina damooze maaqqane. </char></note> inggi ‹Ta maaqqii ye7ode wontsis hyanna miishitira zal7ote› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>«Yinna sa7ite yeze asuntsi eza ixxize gisho hyay atstse nuulla afa ka7itode fana nu koyoos yaga7i asi E suubara kiittida.<verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>«Maaqqikon, ye atstse kaati maaqqii fa sa7a maaqqida. Yentsi taphphi aruntsii E inggide miishito akko gaar zal7i tirfizezako erodes koyi unttana xeegizida.<verse eid="LUK 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>«Tiinosse yi7i, ‹Laatstso, ne taas inggide minaanize melle taphpho tirfida› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>«Eza Laatstse, ‹Naate ammaninttide arizayo lo77o oochchida. Ne eerats baza ammaninttide gisho nees taphphi katamalla afa adetits wolqqa inggida› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>«Lam7antsizay yi7i, ‹Laatstso, ne taas inggide minaanize melle ichchin tirfida› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>«Laatstsii eego, ‹Neesin mahi ichchin katamalla afa adetits wolqqa inggida› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>«Yikke hyaydzantsize yi7i, ‹Laatstso, ta curqqara xaaxii naagide ne miishita hyannashe. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Akkos gayko, neenii nebaz maaqqoosse baz ekkizannon ne budikaayzebaz maxize iita wozina mintsi asi maaqqide gisho nees zhashtida› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>«Eza laatstse mahi, ‹Naate iita arizayo ne doonttii gaar ta nena firddoda. Ta gaddikaayzebaz ekkizannon budikaayzebaz maxize asi maaqqizanno ne erizako, <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>ta yi7i ta minaaniza tirfera ekkode fana zal7ize asis akkos inggika?›<verse eid="LUK 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>«Eza laatstse yinna besite eqqiduntsago, ‹Eera yeze minaaniza ekkii taphpho tirfizidays inggote› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>«Un, ‹Laatstso, ees tiinon taphphi minaane yene› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>«Laatstsii, ta yinttis ohine; ‹Yeze ubbuntsis melle gujunttoda, yezin bazeppa melle atto ees yezannan ekkinttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Maato. 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mar. 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luqa. 8:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Maaqqo yezin, ta unttalla afa ka7itaame fana koyduntsi yentsi ta morkkuntsana hyankka ta tiintte ki7i wodhote› gayda» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Maato. 25:14-30</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa damma bonchchora Yerusalaame gelida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Maato. 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar. 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Waha. 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Yesuusa yinno ohidannippa suuba unttappa tiino aadhii yedhdhii Yerusalaame qitida. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Shamahe Derizella<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:29 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Shamahe dere: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Shamahe gaama dolize dere ga7inttane.</char></note> afa yeze Beetefaagen Bitaaniya ukkide wode fa tamaaruntsappa lam77untsana yaga7i kiittida: <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>«Yin tiino yeze kara gancce qitote, yin yeyga yellize wode ooden toggikaayze acinttii yeze hyare na7a demmada. Eza billii hyayga ekkii yo7ote. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Ooden, ‹Akkos bille?› ga7i oociko, ‹Laatstsii eza koyane› yaga7ote» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Kiitinttiduntsi hyanggi E gaydanni fana yi7in bi7ida. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Un hyare na7aya billodera laatstsuntsi bi7i, «Hyare na7aya akkos bille?» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Un mahi, «Laatstsii eza koyane» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Yeygappa hyare na7aya Yesuusago ki7ida. Fa ma7ito hyare na7ay bantte gaddii Yesuusa hyare na7ayilla betitsida. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Asuntsin E yedhdhize ogitilla fa ma7ito yiixxida.<verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Shamahe dere sulle wodhdhize ogizego ukkize wode faydora loytsii gaama asuntsana un bi7i kille bazite ufaytti fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii,<verse eid="LUK 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>«Laatstse suntsite ye7ize kaatize anjjinttidaya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">salo gidda saro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">Ubbappa dhoqqa salo bonchcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">Xoozis maaqqe.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 19:38">Yaga7i Xooz galatida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Maz. 118:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Asunts giddappa fettii fettii Farisaawuntsi Yesuusago, «Asttamaarizayo, ne tamaaruntsana hyayzote ga7i kacco» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>E unttago, «Un si77i gayko shuchchuntsi uukkoda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Yesuusa Yerusalaame ukkite katamito bi7i iis yeekkida. <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>«Nees saro maaqqadanno hyayno ne erizebaz maaqqizako yezin, hyatte ne aaftippa genggida. <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Ne morkkuntsi ne kantto gasii dumma dumma ogera nena teqqii un7itsize wode ye7oda. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Nenan ne gasiti gidda yeze ne na7untsana dhabssoda. Fettii fettii shuchchi dentsii wul7oda, akkos gayko Xoozii nena ashshodes ye7ize wodito erikaaya» yaga7i iisi yeekkida.<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Xoozze keetstsa zal7izuntsana kessida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa Xoozze keetstsa gelii zal77izuntsana yeygappa bay7ida. <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>Mahi, «‹Ta keetsita Xooz woossize keetstsi maaqqada› ga7i xaafinttida, yezin yin ta keetsito faanuntsi wom7o mahida» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa. 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Er. 7:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Awara awara Xoozze Keetstsite tamaarssane. Kahinunts hyalaquntsi, higge asttamaaruntsin gade cimuntsi eza wodhodes oge koyane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:37">Luqa. 21:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Maaqqo yezin, asuntsi ubbanna E timirttito fa wozintto olii si7ize gisho unttis oochchode baz dhabida.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa adetitsi wolqqita Ayhuduntsis oochi maaqqida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Maato. 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar. 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Fettii qamma Yesuusa Xoozze Keetstsa asuntsana tamaarssitteran Wonggele markkidhite, kahinunts hyalaquntsi, higge asttamaaruntsin gade cimuntsi fettilla eego yi7i, <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>«Ne hyantsesana akko adetitsi wolqqara oochchizako nuus oho. Hyanna adetitsi wolqqito nees inggide oode?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="LUK 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>E unttago, «Taanin yinttana fettibaz oocoda, ane taas mahote. <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>Xammaqize Wahannisa xinqqata Xoozappane asappa?» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Un wol gidda yaga7i zorinttida: «Xoozappa gayko yeezin, akkos ammananxido?» yaga7oda.<verse eid="LUK 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>«Asappa gayko, asuntsi ubbanna Wahannisa nabe maaqqizanno ammanze gisho nuna shuchchara dhogoda.»<verse eid="LUK 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Yinnii gisho, «Abap yezako nu erosi» yaga7i mahida.<verse eid="LUK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Yikke, taanin akko adetitsi wolqqara hyantsesana oochchizako yinttis ohoos» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Woyne oochchizunts aazize</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Maato. 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar. 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa yaga7i hyanna aazizto asuntsis ohida: «Fettii asi woyne tukkida. Oochchizuntsis kotstse inggi gaama wode gam77i yo7odes melle sa7a qitida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 5:1">Isa. 5:1</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Woyne aafto maxize wode yellin woyne aaftippa ees dakkode fana oochchizuntsago fa ariza kiittida. Yezin oochchizuntsi ye ariza aykkii hyadhdhii hyarii kushe dakkida. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Mahin melle ariza kiittida. Mahi oochchizuntsi eza hyadhdhii, kawushshizii hyarii kushe dakkida. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Hyatten mahi hyaydzintsa ariza kiittida. Wootizuntsi ezan hyadhdhii hyarggizii woyne giddappa gaxa kessii olida.<verse eid="LUK 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>«Woyne laatstse, ‹Yeezin ta akko oochcho? Ane mahi ta kadhize ta na7aya dakkoda; oode erode un eza bonchchikaayzara attaama› yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>«Yezin oochchizuntsi atstse na7aya bi7ide wode ‹Hyayni eza laattodaya, hyayga yo7ote eza wodhoda, yeyziko laatita nuus maaqqada› yaga7i zorinttida. <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Woyne giddappa gaxa kessii wodhida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">«Yeezin, woyne laatstse yentsi asuntsana wayssade? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>Yi7i yentsi oochchizuntsana dhabssoda, woyne bestto melle asuntsis inggoda. Asuntsi yinno si7eze wode ‹Shinchchalle yinnii gaarzebaz ki7ippe› » yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Yesuusa unttana dakkii bi7i,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">Yeezin «Gimbbe keexxize asuntsi boride shuchchize,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">keetstsis mintsin xalatitsi inggize ubbannippa aadhize shuchchi maaqqida»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 20:17">«ga7intti xaafinttidanni bilitsita akko?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Maz. 118:22</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Ye shuchchizella afa gol7ize ubbanna meqqoda, shuchchize eella afa wodhdhize ubbanna gaacinttoda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Higge asttamaaruntsin kahinunts hyalaquntsi yinna aazizita ohinttidanna unttalla afa maaqqidanno erii ye wode eza aykkodes koyda, yezin asuntsis zhashtida.<verse eid="LUK 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Giira baz</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Maato. 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar. 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Yinnii gisho, Yesuusa worzhito ahize Roome kaatizes aatsii immades koyi E doonttippa bala qaala naagane. Yinno folisades xillo gaara yi7i cimmize asuntsana eego kiittida. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Kiitinttii hyanggide asuntsi, «Asttamaarizayo, neenii ohizannan tamaarssizanna likke maaqqizanno, mahi Xoozze ogito turira tamaarssizannon oonan shagoosanno nu erane. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Yi7o yezin, Roome kaatis giira giirodes beezanene beezosa?» yaga7i eza oocida.<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Yezin E un wozina iitatitsito eride gisho <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>«Ane tana fettii santime beezote, Eella yeze misiltan suntsita oodebazo?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Un mahi, «Roome Kaati» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>E mahi, «Yeezako, Qeesarestto Qeesares, Xoozzesito Xoozis inggote» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Yinnii gisho, E mahide mahite asuntsi tiintte bala denggodes dandda7ikaaya. E mahite gaama qoppii si77i gayda.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hyayqoppa denddebaz</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Maato. 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar. 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Hyayqoppa denddo baaya yagaaze Saduqaawuntsappa fete fete Yesuusago yi7i,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 23:8">Hawa. 23:8</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>«Asttamaarizayo, fettii asi machcho ekkii na7a yelikaayzara hyayqqiko, E ishe yinna machchito ekkii na7a yelii fa ishes kochchi ashshode fana Muse xaafida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Mahe 25:5</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Yikke laappun ishuntsi yene. Anggisse machcho ekkii na7a yelikaayzara hyayqqida. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Lam7antsize izo ekkii na7a yelikaayzara hyayqqida. <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>Hyaydzantsize yinnii fana yi7ida. Laappununtsi ubbanna yinnii gaara yi7i izo ekkida, yezin na7a yelikaayzara hyayqqida. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Ubbappa suuba machchita hyayqqida. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Yikke, laappun dhiiratsi izo ekkide gisho hyayqoppa denddize wode iza oode machcho maaqqade?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Asi hyanna wodite ekkane gelane. <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>Yezin hyayqoppa denddii ye7ode alamite yessades beezuntsii ekkosi geloos. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Un kiitanchcho fana maaqqize gisho tiinoppa hyayqqoos. Hyayqoppa denddide gisho un Xoozze na7a. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Muse Laatstsii, ‹Abrahama Laatstsii, Yisaaqa Laatstsii, Yayqooba Laatstsii› ga7i cil7o gidda eexize tama taarikito xaafidanne hyayqqide asuntsi denddizanno beezane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Keze 3:6</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Ubbuntsi ees faxa yezuntsana maaqqade gisho E faxa yezunts Laatstsap attin hyayqqiduntsi Laatstsii baaya» yaga7i mahida.<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Higge asttamaaruntsappa fete fete, «Asttamaarizayo, lo77o baz ohida» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Yinnippa suuba, melle ooce oocodes zhashtida.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosa oode na7a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Maato. 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar. 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Yinnippa kaallii Yesuusa unttago, «Asuntsi Kiristtoosa wayzi Dawute na7a ga7e? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42-43"/>Akkos gayko, Dawute fa ommite Mazmure maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42-43">« ‹Xoozii ta Laatstsego «Ta ne morkkuntsana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42-43">ne tohita yedhdhize bessi mahode wontsis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42-43">taappa mizaqi zalara betto» gayda yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:42-43 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz. 110:1</ref> </char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:42-43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>«Yikke, Dawute Kiristtoosa, ‹Laatstso ga7i xeegittera ees na7a wayzi maaqqe?› » yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Asi ubba si7adera fa tamaaruntsago, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>«Pharggo ma7o ma77i wuta kadhizuntsappa, gabe bonchcho sarotse, Ayhude woosa Keetstsite bonchcho oyda, mokunttize keetstsan bonchcho bessi koyze higge asttamaaruntsappa naaginttote. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Un budan keetstsi kallo ashshizuntsana, xillo asi gaar yi7i woosa pharggizane. Un iita firdda ekkoda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Budantti muxaate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mar. 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Dure asi Xoozze Keetstsa muxaate saaxintte olodera Yesuusa dhoqi ga7i asuntsana bi7ida. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Mahi fettii daha budantta lam77i sikkina olodera bi7i, <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>«Ta yinttis turo ohine; hyanna daha budantta ubbannippa aatsii inggida. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Akkos gayko, hyantsi asuntsi ubbanna faas yeze bazappa inggida, yezin iza fa facitippa, faas yeze yestto mulo inggida» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssutsi wode malla</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Maato. 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-23">Mar. 13:3-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Yesuusa tamaaruntsappa fete fete Xoozze Keetsita gaama lo77ize shuchcharan asi Xoozis inggide imora lo77idanno ohinttane. <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>Yezin Yesuusa, «Hyanna yin be7ize bazita ubbanna lanttikaayzara, shuchchi shuchchalla afa gimbbinttide fana hyannira attoose wode ye7oda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Unttin, «Asttamaarizayo, hyanna ubbanna hyanodanna ayde? Mahi hyanna hyanodannis mallita akko?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Yesuusa yaga7i unttis mahe inggida: «Balinttaame gaar naaginttote. Gaamuntsi fana, ‹Ta Kiristtoosa, wodita ukkida› yaga7ite ta suntsite ye7oda, yezin yin unttana kaallippete. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Yin olabazin as iitatitsi si7ize wode tannippete. Yinna tiinidhii yi7odanna attaamebaz maaqqade gisho wode wurssutsita ellisii ye7oos» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Kaallin, «Worzha worzhalla afa, ka7itumo ka7itumolla afa denddoda. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Damma sa7a eni7e hyanoda, gado hyargge naye bay7en dumma dumma bessa gaammada, zhashize bazin damma malla saloppa benttoda. <verse eid="LUK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>Yezin hyanna ubbanna hyanodannippa tiino ta suntsiti gisho ga7i asi yinttana baytsoda aykkoda. Ayhude woosa Keetstsa firddi achchi keetstsa yinttana oloda. Kaat tiinon worzha ahizuntsii tiino yinttana kanggoda. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Yinnan ta baz yin unttis markkidhades lo77o oge maaqqada. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Yinnii gisho, yin oocinttize wode waaga7i mahe immade ga7i yin wozintte un7inttaame fana qoppote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Luqa. 12:11-12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>Akkos gayko, yin morkkuntsi yinttara eqinttodesin lallodes dandda7oosse doonan cinccatitsi ta yinttis inggoda. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Melle atto yezin, yinttana yeliduntsi, yin ishuntsi, yin iginuntsi lagguntsi yinttana aatsii inggoda. Yin giddappa feta feta wodhoda. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Ta suntsiti gisho asi ubba tiintte yin ixinttiduntsana maaqqada. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Yezin melle atto yezin, yin omma isintsitippa feten dhaboos. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Mintsii dandda7ara yin, yin shemppito ashshoda.»<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaame dhabe baz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>«Yerusalaame katamita allaga wottaddarera gasintti bettezin yin bi7iko iis dhabe ukkidanno erote. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Ye wode Yihuda yeze ubbanna derego woxxii dhabo, katamite yezuntsi yeygappa kezo, gaxare yezuntsi katama gelippe. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Akkos gayko, hyanna xaafinttidanna folinttode gaar yinna Xoozze kushe mahize wode.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:7">Hose. 9:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Sa7alla afa damma madha ye7oda, hyannen asalla afa Xoozze baadditsi ye7oda. Yinnii gisho, wodatsi maachuntsisin dhantsizuntsis bade. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Un mashshara hyayqqoda, asi ubbanna allaga sa7a yessada. Ayhude maaqqoosse asunts wodita folinttode wontsis Yerusalaame unttara yedhinttidanno maaqqada.<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">As Na7ay mahi yo7oda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>«Awan, aginan, xoolinttolla afa malla benttoda. Abbappan zuluntte en7e denddidannippa sa7a yeze asi un7inttoda yirggoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa. 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Hiz. 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:31">Er. 2:31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Qon. 6:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Salo wolqqita buqunttode gisho asi zhashmoran sa7alla afa akko yi7adyessa ga7i naagora tannoda. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Ye wode As Na7ay wolqqaran damma bonchchoran dhonnera ye7odera un be7ada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dane. 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Qon. 1:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Yinttana ashshize ukkide gisho hyanna hyanizanna folinttodes aykkize wode giiginttii eqqote, yin ommito dhoqi yiizii bo7ote» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Kaallin, hyannigaara ga7i aazize ohida: «Belese minxan melle minxa ubba bo7ote. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Un aacize wode torchche ukkidanno yin erane. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Yinnii gaara hyanna hyanizanna folinttodera yin bi7iko Xoozze ka7itumo ukkidanno erote.<verse eid="LUK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>«Ta yinttis turo ohine; hyanna ubbanna folinttode wontsis hyanna yeletitsita aadhoos. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Salon sa7an aadhoda, yezin ta qaaltta aadhoos.<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>«Yikke, bore baayze yessara, ushi gaantsera yesi bazis un7inttera yin wozintta aykkinttaame gaaran yinna qammita tiirikaayzin xike fana yinttana aykaame fana naaginttote. <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>Yinna qammita sa7a kumutsite yeze ubbuntsalla afa yelloda. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Yinnii gisho, ye7ize baz ubbappa attodesin As Na7a tiintte eqqodes dandda7inttode fana ubba wode miinggi woossote» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Awara awara Yesuusa Xoozze Keetstsite tamaarssite, qamma qamma Shamahe Derizella afa kezii aqane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luqa. 19:47</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Asi ubba eza si7odes wontta gooda eego Xoozze keetstsa ye7ine.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Yihuda Yesuusa aatsii inggodes zorinttida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Maato. 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 14">14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16">16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar. 14:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">10-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Waha. 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Ye wode Faasika gaaze boora Ba7ale ukkida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1">Keze 12:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Kahinunts hyalaquntsin higge asttamaaruntsi asuntsis zhashtide gisho wayzi Yesuusa fa giddappa dhabssodyezako oge koyane. <verse eid="LUK 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Xalahe taphpho lam77untsappa feta maaqqide Asqorootu Yihuda ga7inttize gidda gelida. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Yihuda kahinunts hyalaquntsisin Xoozze Keetstsa naagizuntsi hyalaquntsago hyanggi Yesuusa wayzi aatsii immadyezako unttara zorinttida. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Unttin yinne ufaytti bira immades eera zorinttida. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Ezin zorinttidanne giigida. Aatsii unttis immades asi baayze wottize wode naagitera yene.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssutsi kawo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Maato. 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mar. 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Waha. 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Yinnippa suuba, Faasika duro shukinttize boora Ba7ale yellida. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Yesuusa, «Faasika kawo ma7ade gaar hyanggi nuus giigizote» yaga7i Phexiroosan Wahannisan kiittida. <verse eid="LUK 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Un, «Nu aba giigisade gaar ne koye» yaga7i oocida. <verse eid="LUK 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>E unttago, «Yikke yin katama gelodera hyaatsi otara tookkide atstse yinttara yelinttoda. E hyanggi gelize keetstsite eza kaallii gelote. <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>Kartti adego asttamaarize, ‹Ta ta tamaaruntsara wolla Faasika kawo ma7ades zaqqo keetsita aba yene? yagayda› ga7ote. <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>E fooqella afa yiixxintti giigii yeze dalgga kifile yinttana beessada, yeyga giigizote» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Un hyanggi Yesuusa ga7idanni gaara hyanin denggida. Faasika ba7ale kawo yeyga giigizida.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Saatan yellide wode Yesuusa hawaaruntsara wolla kawolla bettida. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>E unttago, «Ta madha ekkodannippa tiinii hyanna faasika kawuto yinttara ma7ades gaama amudhdhida. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Yikke, si7ote! Xoozze ka7itumtte hyannis bilitsita folinttode wontsis hyanna kawuto mahi mo7oos» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Ushito ekkii galatii maaqqii, «Hya7ate hyanno yin gidda gishinttote. <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Si7ote! Xoozze ka7itumo ye7ode wontsis hyaynoppa aykkii hyanna woyne ushitippa mahi uzhoos» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Booriza ekkii, galatii maaqqii, «Hyanna yinttis ingginttidanna ta ashtto. Hyanno oochitera tana tiirote» yaga7i baxxi unttis inggida.<verse eid="LUK 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Yinnii fana, kawutippa suuba ushshito ekkii, «Hyanna ushshita yinttis goggide ta suutsite folinttize kille caaqo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31">Er. 31:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>Maaqqikon, tana aatsii inggode atstse kushita taara fettilla gabate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Maz. 41:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>As Na7ay ees Xoozii gayde fana hyayqqodes yene, yezin eza aatsii inggize atstsa bade» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Un fa gidda, «Hyanno oonii oochchode» ga7i wol oocida.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oode nuuppa damma?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Mahi un gidda damma maaqqade oode gaaze lalle medhinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:1">Maato. 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:34">Mar. 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46">Luqa. 9:46</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Alame kaatuntsi fa asuntsana wolqqara ahane; fa derttilla afa laatsidhizuntsanan fana, ‹Lo77o oochchizuntsana› yaga7i xeegane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:25-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:25-27">Maato. 20:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-44">Mar. 10:42-44</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Yezin yin gidda yinnii fana maaqqippe. Yin gidda angisize geezze fana yi7o;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Maato. 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mar. 9:35</ref></char></note>kaalitsize kaallizefana yi7o. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Yeezin, mokkizeppan Mokinttizeppa aaye aadhe? Mokinttiza baane? Yezin taanii yin gidda mokkize fana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:12">Qon. 13:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>«Yinttin ta madhite taappa shaakkinttikaayzar taara miinggi eqqiduntsana. <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29-30"/>Yin ta leematippa ma7ade fana, ushshade fanan araatalla afa bettii taphpho lam77i Isra7eele sheeshuntsalla afa firddode gaar ta aday tana shuumide fana taanin yinttana ta ka7itumtte shuumoda» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:29-30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Maato. 19:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:29-30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>Kaallii Yesuusa, «Simoona, Simoona, Xalahe yinttana zarga fana hyarqqodes woossida. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Yezin ta ne ammantta dhabaame fana nees cimidhdhane. Neenin maaqqide wode ne ishuntsana miintso» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Simoona, «Laatstso, ta neera acinttodesin hyayqqodes giiginttida» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Yesuusa Phexiroosago, «Ta nees ohine; hyayno lukule uukkodannippa tiino ne tana hyaydzdzii tohe kaddoda» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Kaallii, Yesuusa unttago, «Taanii yinttana korojjo, karxitten caamma baayzin kiitteze wode yinttis faccidebaz yene?» yaga7i oocida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:9-10">Maato. 10:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-9">Mar. 6:8-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3">Luqa. 9:3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Un mahi, «Akkon faccikaaya» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>E unttago, «Hyatte korojjon karxite yeze aykko; mashsha baayze fa afultto bayzi mashsha wonggo. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Hyanno si7ote! ‹Genuntsara faydinttida› ga7intti xaafinttidanna ta gidda folinttodes beezane. Yee, ta gisho xaafinttidanna folinttizanna turidhida» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa. 53:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>E tamaaruntsi, «Laatstso hyanne lam77i mashsha yene» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">E, «Maaqqada» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Shamahe Derizella woossida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Maato. 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar. 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Yesuusa tiinoppa kezizanni gaara denddii Shamahe Derizella kezida. E tamaaruntsi eza kaallida. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Yinna besite yellide wode «Madha gelaame fana woossote» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 22:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Unttappa shuchchi dhogin yellode bessi gaar hyaakki bunqqunttii woossida. <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>«Ta adayo, ne qofa maaqqiko hyanna madha xuu7uto taappa aatstso. Yezin ta qofa maaqqippe ne qofa hyano» yaga7i woossida. <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Kiitanchcho saloppa benttii mintsitsida. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Gaama un7intti mintsii woossane. E cawutan suutsi xokkize gaar sa7ite xokkane.<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Yesuusa woosa polii fa tamaaruntsago yi7ida. Un, azzanoppa denddii labbii genttezin denggi, <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>«Akkos gentte? Faatana gelaame fana denddii woossote» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa aykkinttida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Maato. 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar. 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Waha. 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>E hyaga ohella afa yezin gaama asuntsi yi7ida. Taphpho lam77untsappa fete Yihuda ga7inttize unttana kaalitsane. E Yesuusa yeerodes kale shiiqida. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Yezin Yesuusa, «Yihuda, As Na7aya yeerii aatsii inggoda?» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Yesuusa tamaaruntsi yinna hyanzanno bi7i, «Laatstso mashshara gachcho?» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Un giddappa fete kahinunts hyalaqiza guuddii mizaqi hyayza gachchii olida.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Yezin Yesuusa, «Ashsho! Kayppete»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:51 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ashsho! Kayppete: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesuusa hyanna besite ashsho gaydanna eza ashshodes ga7i asuntsi atstse hyayza gachchidanno ashsho gachchippe ga7idannon, melluntsi eza aykkodes yi7iduntsana kayppete hyanna un wode yagaydanno lam77i qofuntsana wol yeltsi aykkida.</char></note> yagayda. Atstse hyayza bochchii fatstsida.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa fana aykkodes yi7ide kahinunts hyalaquntsago, Xoozze Keetstsa naagizunts shuumuntsagon cimuntsago, «Faanno aykkize asi fana mashshan gufe aykkii yi7idate? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Ubba wode Xoozze Keetstsite ta yinttara yeze wode taalla afa kushe gaddikaaya. Yezin hyanna dhuma ka7itumo ahide woden yin woden» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luqa. 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiroosa Yesuusa kaddida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Maato. 26:57-58</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:67-75">67-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mar. 14:53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Waha. 18:12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa aykkii kahinunts hyalaqize woofa kanggida. Phexiroosa hyaakora Yesuusa kaallane. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Asuntsi kahinunts hyalaqize woofa tama eetsii wolla bettezin Phexiroosa unttara wolla bettida. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Fettii arita Phexiroosa tama kale bettidanno dakkii bi7i, «Hyay atstse eera yene» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 22:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Yezin Phexiroosa, «Hyanna maachite ta ye atstsa erosi» yaga7i kaddida.<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Eerats wodeppa suuba fettii melle asi eza bi7i, «Neenin unttappa feta» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Yezin Phexiroosa, «Hyay atstsayo tana baaya» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Fettii saate gaar gam77idannippa suuba fettii melle atstse loytsii, «Hyay atstsay Galilappa maaqqade gisho so7e baayzin eera yene» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 22:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Yezin Phexiroosa, «Hyay atstsayo, ne gaazaya ta eroos» yagayda. E yinna ohito hyaasikaayizin lukule oollida.<verse eid="LUK 22:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Laatstsii suuba maaqqii Phexiroosa bi7ida. Phexiroosa, «Hyayno lukule oollodannippa tiino ne tana hyaydzdzii tohe kaddoda» yaga7i, Laatstsii ohide qaaltto tiirida. <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Phexiroosa bale kezii gaama goqii yeekkida.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Philaaxoosa tiinon Heroodisa tiino shiiqida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Maato. 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar. 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Waha. 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Yesuusa naagize asuntsi eza leqqen hyadhdhe aykkida. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>E aafito goozii «Ane tinbbite oho; nena hyadhdhide oode?» yaga7i oocane. <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Melle gaama leqqii cazhane.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Sa7a wonttize wode Ayhude sa7a cimuntsi, kahinunts hyalaquntsin higge asttamaaruntsagon shangguntsago shiiqii, Yesuusa fa tiino shiishida. <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>Un, «Ne Kiristtoosa? Ane nuus oho?» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Yesuusa, «Ta ohizako ammanoos. <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>Ta oocizako mahoos. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Yezin As Na7ay hyannippa gode bagga wolqqaama Xoozze mizaqi zalar bettoda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Ye wode ubbanna, «Yeezin, ne Xooz na7a?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">E, «Ta Xoozze na7a yin gaydanni fana» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Un, «Yikke, melle markka akko koshshe? E fa il7antsite ohodera nu si7ida» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Philaaxoosa tiino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Maato. 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar. 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Waha. 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Yinna besite shiiqide shangguntsi ubbanna denddii Yesuusa Philaaxoosago kanggida. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>«Hyay atstse nu asuntsana balitsodera, Roome kaatis giira giiraame fana kayoderan mahi, ‹Taanii Kiristtoosa yin kaati› yagaazin denggida» yaga7i mootida.<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Philaaxoosa Yesuusa, «Neenii Ayhuduntsi kaatine?» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesuusa, «Ye, ne ga7idanni gaar» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Philaaxoosa kahinunts hyalaquntsagon asuntsago, «Hyay atstsella afa ta fettii bala baz denggikaaya» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Yezin un, «Hyay atstse Galilappa aykkii hyanno yellodes Yihuda kumutsi iitabazis dentsitsane» yaga7i mintsii ohida.<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Philaaxoosa yinno si7eze wode Yesuusa Galila asi yezako erodes koyi eza oocida. <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Yesuusa Heroodisa sa7appa yi7ide asi maaqqizanno Philaaxoosa eride wode Heroodisa ye wode Yerusalaame yeze gisho eego dakkida.<verse eid="LUK 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Heroodisa tiino shiiqida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Heroodisa Yesuusa be7ades gaama wodeppa koyitera yeze gisho eza be7eze wode gaama ufayttida. Akkos gayko, E baz si7ide gisho gaama qofize baz oochchin be7ades amudhdhiter yene. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Heroodisa Yesuusa gaama oochi oocida, yezin E akkon mahikaaya. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Kahinuntsi hyalaquntsin higge asttamaaruntsi ize eqqii mintsii eza mootane. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Heroodisaran E wottaddaruntsara Yesuusa toochii leqqida. Bonchcho afula ma7isii Philaaxoosago mahi dakkida. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Heroodisaran Philaaxoosara tiino morkke yezar ye wode wolla giigida.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa hyayqo firdda firddinttida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Philaaxoosa kahinunts hyalaquntsana, as ahizuntsanan fettilla xeegii, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>« ‹Hyay atstse asi wobbo bazis dentsitsane› ga7i taago ki7ida. Taanin yin tiintte qurichin yin shiishide mootis akko bala baz denggikaaya. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Heroodisa, yinnii gaar akko bala baz eella afa denggikaayze gisho nuugo dakkida. Turon hyay atstse hyayqos yeltsize akko bala baz oochchikaaya. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Yinnii gisho, eza garafii billii dakkoda» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>Yinno E ga7idanna Faasika Ba7ale wode fettii asi unttis billodanna ees attaamebaz maaqqide gishos.<verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Worzhuntsi ubba fettilla, «Hyay atstsa wodho, nuus Barbbaane billo» yaga7i uukkida. <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Barbbaane katama gidda asuntsana iitabazis dentsitsii asi wodhii acinttide asi.<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Philaaxoosa Yesuusa billodes koyi asuntsis mahi ohida. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Maaqqikon, asuntsi, «Suxxo! Suxxo!» yaga7i uukkida. <verse eid="LUK 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Philaaxoosa hyaydzintsa, «Hyay atstse qohide baz akko? Wodhes yeltsize bala ta denggikaaya. Yinnii gisho, garafii dakkii ashshoda» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Un fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Suxunttodes beezane» ga7i mintsii uukkida. Un uukki gamida. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Un oociti gisho ga7i Philaaxoosa eella firddida. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Asi iitabazis dentsitsizayan as wodhii acinttidaya billode fana woossida, ye atstsa unttis billida. Yezin Yesuusa un koydebaz oochchode gaar unttis aatsii inggida.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa suxxida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:31-44">Maato. 27:31-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar. 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Waha. 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Yesuusa aykkii kanggodera Simoona gaaze Qereena sa7a atstse gaxareppa ye7odera, denggi masqala toossii Yesuusa kaallii hyammade fana un7itsida. <verse eid="LUK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Gaama asuntsin fa dadabito qoxxitera yeekkize maachuntsi E suubara kaallane.<verse eid="LUK 23:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Yezin Yesuusa unttago suuba maaqqii, «Yin, Yerusalaame maachuntso, yin ommitisin yin na7untsis yeekkotep attin taas yeekkippete. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>‹Yikke dhoontsuntsin, yelikaayze sazttan dhantsikaayze ammita anjjinttida› yin yagawude qamma ye7oda. <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Ye wode dertto, ‹Nuulla afa gol7o›, zooziton, ‹Nuna aachcho› gawuda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hose. 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:16">Qon. 6:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Yikke, qaye minxalla hyanni gaar yiiziko mela minxa wayssad yessa?» gayda.<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Ezara wodhodes melle lam77i iita baz oochchiduntsana kanggida. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Qeeraniyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:33 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Qeeraniyo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Qeeraniyo gaazanna Girike doona. Aramayke doonara «Golggotta» woy «Omma liiphe» ga7e. Qeeraniyo gaaze suntsita ingginttidanna Yesuusa suxunttidanna as omma liiphe aaze bessa maaqqide gishos. Yinna bessita Roome ka7itumo iita baz oochchiduntsana suxxize bessi. (Maato 27:33; Mar. 15:22; Waha. 19:17)</char></note> ga7inttize besito yeltsi suxxida. Iita baz oochchiduntsappa feta mizaqi zalara hyankkaya workkita zalara suxxida. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Yesuusa, «Ta adayo, un akko oochchizako eroosse gisho ne unttis atto ga7o» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Maz. 22:18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Un E afulttilla afa ixa olii shaakkintti ekkida.<verse eid="LUK 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Asuntsi eqqii be7ine, yezin gade ahizuntsii, «Melluntsana ashshida; Xoozii dooride Kiristtoosa E maaqqizako ane fana ashsho» yaga7i leqqida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Maz. 22:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:7">Maz. 22:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Wottaddaruntsi E kale shiiqii, caala woyne ushi inggida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Maz. 69:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>Yeyzi, «Neenii Ayhudunts kaati maaqqiko ne ommito ashsho» yaga7i leqqida.<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Ees omma zalara, «Hyay Ayhudunts kaati» yagaaze xuufe gaddida. <verse eid="LUK 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Suxunttide iita baz oochchiduntsappa fete cashshi sa7ara gochchitera, «Ane neenii Kiristtoosa maaqqiko, nenan nunan ashsho» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Yezin hyankkay, «Ne hyannii gaar firdda yezite melle atto yezin, Xoozis zhashtoosa? <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Nuunii nu balttis beezize firdda ekkane, yezin hyay atstse fettii iitabazin oochchikaaya» yaga7i kaccida.<verse eid="LUK 23:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Mahin, «Yesuusa, ne ne ka7itumora ye7ize wode tana qoppo» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Yesuusa, «Ta nees turo ohine; hyayno ne taara gannate maaqqada» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44-45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44-45"/>Ye wode izippun saateppa hyanggi uddufun saate yellodes awa foo7ito kayde gisho sa7a ubbanne dhuma maaqqida. Xoozze Keetstsa magaraajjita feedhinttii lam77i shaakkinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:44-45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31">Keze 26:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:44-45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Yesuusa, qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Ta adayo, ta ta shemppito ne kushite inggane» yaga7i hyayqqida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:5">Maz. 31:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Mato hyalaqize, hyanidanno bi7i, «Hyay atstse turo xillo» yaga7i Xooz galatida. <verse eid="LUK 23:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Yinna hyanide bazito bo7odes yinna besite shiiqide asi ubbanna hyanidanno be7eze wode fa dadabito qoxxitera fa kara maaqqida. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Maaqqikon, Yesuusa kalera erize asuntsi ubbanna, yinnii gaara Galilappa kaallii yi7ide maachuntsi yinno bi7ite hyaakora eqqida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2">Luqa. 8:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51"/>Ayhude shangguntsappa fetay, Yoosefa ga7inttize atstse yene. E Armmatiyasa ga7inttize Yihuda katamappa yi7ida. E lo77on Xillo asi maaqqide gisho Xoozze ka7itumo ye7ito naagane. Shangguntsappa feta maaqqii un zorintten oochite baaya. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Ye atstse Philaaxoosago hyanggi, Yesuusa ahito moogodes taas inggo ga7i woossida. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Yesuusa ahito ketstsii afulara xaaxida. Laallappa woocinttide wom7o melle asi mooginttikaayze boozite gaddida. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Sambbata gelodes yiize gisho yinna wodita giigintte qamma.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Galilappa denddii Yesuusa kaallii yi7ide maachuntsi Yoosefara hyanggi E ahito wayzi moogizako booztto akaakii bi7ida. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Izippa maaqqii shitton qibaate giigizida. Higge kiittizanni gaar Sambbata awarito shemppii peezhida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Keze 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:14">Mahe 5:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa hyayqoppa denddida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Maato. 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar. 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Waha. 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Saaminttappa tiino qamma, wogga wode wontta gooda, maachuntsi fa giigizide shitto ekkii booza hyanggida. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Un ize yellize wode booza doontte yeze shuchchita gol7i hyal7idanno denggida. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Un booza gaatsi gelida, yezin Laatstse Yesuusa ahito denggikaaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Un ize eqqii akko hyanido ga7i qoppodera akaakikaayzin gaama foo7ize afula ma77ide lam77i asuntsi un kale eqqida. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Maachuntsi zhashti fa omito sa7a ziqqii yiizii yessadera, asuntsi unttago, «Faxa yezaya hyayquntsi gidda akkos koyete? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6-7"/>E hyanne baaya; hyayqoppa denddida, ‹As Na7ay nagaranchchuntsi kushite aadhii ingginttoda; unttin eza suxxoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Maato. 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:18-19">20:18-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mar. 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33-34">10:33-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luqa. 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18:31-33</ref></char></note>E hyaydzintsa qammite hyayqoppa denddoda› yaga7i, E yinttara Galila yezite yinttis ohide qaaltto qoppote» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 24:6-7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Maachuntsi ye wode E qaaltto tiirida.<verse eid="LUK 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Maachuntsi boozappa maaqqii hyanide bazito ubba taphpho fettuntsisin melluntsisin ohida. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Yentsi hawaaruntsis ohide Magdela Mayramo, Yohaanna, Yayqooba intta Mayramon unttara yeze melle maachuntsana. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Yezin unttis maachuntsi ohidanna abukko gaara yi7in ammanikaaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Yezin Phexiroosa denddii woxxii booza qitida. Yinna bestto yellii zuggii gidda be7ize wode moogide afula xalaala bi7ida. Hyanidanne gaama qoppii fa kara maaqqida.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Emmahuuse ogella afa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mar. 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Ye wode kaallize tamaaruntsappa lam77untsi Yerusalaameppa taphpho fettii kilo mitire hyaakkize Emmahuse kara gancce hyanggane. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Un wolla hyanide bazito ubba ohinttane. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Un yinna hyanidanni baz tiiriteran ohinttitera yedhdhize wode Yesuusa fa ommitis shiiqii unttara hyanggane. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Yezin, un eza eraame fana un aafta aykkinttida.<verse eid="LUK 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>E, «Yin wolla ogella yezite ohinttizanna akko?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Un azzanii si77i ga7i eqqida. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Unttappa fete Qeliyoopha ga7inttize, «Hyanna qammiti gidda Yerusalaame hyanidanno eroosse, ne sa7itis zaqqone?» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>E mahi, «Ize hyanidanna akko?» ga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Un, «Xoozze tiinon asi tiinon oocharan ohera mintsii nabe maaqqide Naazirete Yesuusa baz. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Eza kahinunts hyalaquntsin nuna kaalitsizuntsi hyayqo firddas aatsii inggi, suxxida. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Nuunii Isra7eele asuntsana ashshoda ga7i ufaytti naagezin hyanna hyanin hyayno hyaydzintsa qamma. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Mahi nu giddappa fettii fettii maachuntsi nuna gaama qofizida. Un hyayno wontta gooda booza hyanggida. <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>E ahita dhabide wode maaqqii yi7i, ‹E faxa yene› yagaaze kiitanchchuntsi qonccin bi7ida yaga7i ohida. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Nu giddappan fete fete booza hyanggi maachuntsi ohidanni fana hyanin bi7ida, yezin eza bi7ikaaya» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>E unttago, «Yin, tiiroosse asuntso, yin wozintta nabuntsi ohidanno ubba ammanodes gam7izuntso, <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Kiristtoosa yinna madhito ekkodesin fa bonchchora gelodes beezosa?» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Museppan nabunts ubbannippa denddii Geeshi Maxaafite E baz xaafinttidanno ubba unttis qonccizida.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Un hyanggize kara gancce ukkide wode Yesuusa aadhii hyaako bessa qitize gaara yi7in, <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Un, «Sa7ita qammide gisho nuura aqo» yaga7i mintsii woossida. Yinnii gisho, unttara aqodes gelida.<verse eid="LUK 24:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Unttara wolla leematella bettii, soollo dentsii, feedhii anjjii unttis inggida. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Ye wode un erode gaar un aafta bugunttida. Unttin erida. Yezin E unttappa genggida. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Un, «Nu ogella afa yezin E nuus Geeshi Maxaafe billiteran nuna ohizitera nu wozintta eexika?» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Ye wode denddii suuba Yerusalaame yi7ida. Taphpho fettuntsin melluntsi fettilla shiiqii yessadera denggida. <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>Un, «Laatstsii turo denddida; Simoonas benttida» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 24:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Yentsi lam77i tamaaruntsi Emmahuuse ogella yezin hyanidannon soollo feedhide wode wayzi eza erezako unttis ohida.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsis benttida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Maato. 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar. 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Waha. 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Hawa. 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Lam77i tamaaruntsi yinna ohitilla yezin, Yesuusa un gidda eqqii, «Saro yinttis maaqqe» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Maaqqikon, un tannii, meeshe bi7ide gaara yi7in zhashtida.<verse eid="LUK 24:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>E unttago, «Akkos zhashtido? Akkos so7e yin wozintte gelido? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Ta kushiton ta tohito bo7ote; ta tana. Mahi aykkii bo7ote; tana yin be7izannigaara, meeshes ashon meqatsii baaya» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Yaga7i, fa tohiton fa kushiton unttana beezida. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Un ufayssappa denddidannippa ammananxii gaama qoppii yezin, Yesuusa unttago, «Hyanne yinttis mu7izebaz yene?» yagayda. <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Un fettii michinttide molo ees inggida. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>E ekkii un tiintte mu7ida.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>E, «Ta yinttara gam7ide wode ubbanne Muse higge maxaafite, nabuntsi maxaafiten Mazmure maxaafite, ta gisho xaafinttidanna ubbanna folinttodes beezane yaga7i ta yinttis ohide qaaltta hyanno» yagayda.<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Ye wode Geeshi Maxaafito tiirode gaar wozintto unttis bugida. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>Yinnii fana, «Kiristtoosa madha ekkoda, hyaydzdzintsa qammite hyayqoppa denddoda yaga7i xaafinttida. <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>Yerusalaameppa denddii asi ubbanna nagarappa maarotitsin atotetsi E suntsite markkidhoda. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Yin yinnis markka. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Yikke, taanin ta aday inggide ufayssito yinttis dakkoda. Yin saloppa wolqqa ekkode wontsis Yerusalaame katama gam7ote» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:4">Hawa. 1:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa salo denddida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mar. 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Hawa. 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Yinnippa suuba, Bitaaniya katama unttana ekkii hyanggida. Fa kushito dentsii anjjida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:50-51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Hawa. 1:9-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Unttana anjjite unttappa shaakkintti ude Salo ekinttida. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Un zuggii goynii gaama ufayssara Yerusalaame maaqqida. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Xoozza ubba wode galatitera Xoozze Keetstsa gam7ida.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
